<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">John</book>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">John</para>
  <para style="toc2">John</para>
  <para style="mt">John</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atila chu Thu uma ahin, Thu chu Pathen toh uma ahi, chule Thu chu Pathen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichu atila Pathen toh uma ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thil jouse Ama vanga um ahi; aum jouse hi ama louva um khatcha jong aumpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama-a chun hinna aumin, chule hinna chu mihem vah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin vah chun muthim lah ahinsalin, ahin muthimin anahepoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathen'a kona hinkisol mi khat ahungin, ama chu amin John ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama vanga mi jousen atahsan theina dinga vah thudol chu hettohsah dinga, ama chu hunga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama chu vah chu ahipon, vah thudol chu hettohsah dinga hung kisol joh ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vannoi'a hungah mitin salvah chu vah tahbeh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama chu vannoi'a ahung umin, chule vannoi hi ama sem ahi, ahin vannoi'in ama anahepoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama ama-ate henga hunga ahin, ama-aten anasang pouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahivangin aman anasanga, ama mina tahsan chan chu, Pathen chate ahi theina dingu thaneina apetai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />chuteho chu thisana kona peng hilou, tahsaphe lunglama kona peng jong hilou, mihem lunglama kona peng jong hilouvin, Pathen'a kona peng ahibouvui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin Thu chu tahsaphe ahung soh-in, ilah uva ahung chengin, keihon aloupina, Pa-a kona chapa changkhatseh loupi chu, lungset le thutah dimsetnin kamutaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />John'in ama thudol chu ahettohsah len, Kanunga hunga chu keima sangin amasa jotai; ama keima masang peh-a um jingsa ahi jeh-in, tia kasei chu ama hi ahi, tin asame.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ajeh chu ama aletsetna kon chun, eiho lungset chunga lungset ichang taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ajeh iham itile danthu chu Mosi peh ahin; lungset le thutah chu Christa vanga hung umdoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koiman imatih chanin Pathen amukhapoi; Pa oma beh jing Chapa changkhat chun aphondoh ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem'a kona Juda hon thempuho le danthu sunho John henga, Koi nahim? tia dong dinga asoluva, John thu hettohsah chu hiche ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman aseidoh jenge, aseileppoi; Keima Christa kahipoi, tin aseidoh jenge.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin amahon adongun, Koiba nahim? Elijah nahim? atiule aman, Kahipoi, ati. Themgao chu nahim, atiule, Kahipoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hijeh chun amahon ajah-a, Koi nahim? Eihinsol teho kadonbut theina dinguva, koi kahi nakitim? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman, Keima Isaiah themgao sei, Pakai lampi sem jangun tia, gamthipma khosam-a mi khat aw gin chu kahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahung kisol miho chu Pharisai ho hinsol ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuin amahon adongun ajah-a, Christa nahi louva, chule Elijah la nahi louva, themgao chula nahi loule, ibola baptize nachansah jiham, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />John'in adonbutnin ajah uva, Keiman twija baptize kachansah ji ahin, nalah uva nanghon nahet louvu mi khat adinge.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama chu ahi kanunga hunga, keisanga chungnungjo katichu, keima akengchot khao sutlham hoi jong kahipoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hicheng chu John'in baptize abolna, Jordan galla Bethabara mun'a kibola ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ajingin ahenga Jesu ahung amun, hichun, Veuvin, vannoi chonset pomang, Pathen Kelngoinou khu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama hi ahi, kanunga hunga keima sanga chungnungjo tia kasei chu, ijeh-inem itile ama keima masang peh-a anaumsa ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Keiman ama kanahepoi; ahivangin Israel lah-a ama phondohna dinga, twija baptize chansah-a kahung ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuin John'in ahettohsah-in, Keiman vakhu banga Lhagao chu van'a kona ahung kumlhah-a achunga achuh kamun, achungah aumdentai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chule keiman ama kanahepoi, ahivangin twi'a baptize chansah-a eisola chun kajah-a, Nangman Lhagao ahung kum-a achunga aum namu chu, ama chu Lhagao Thenga baptize chansah ding chu ahi, eiti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chule keiman kamua, Ama hi Pathen Chapa ahi tia kahettohsah ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ajing nikhon John aseijui mini toh ana dingin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesu avale chu agahven, Veuvin, Pathen Kelngoi nou khu! ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chuin aseijuite ni chun athusei chu aja lhonin, Jesu nung ajui lhontai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chuin Jesu akiheijin, amanin anung ajui lhon chu amun, Ipi nahol lhonham, ati. Hichun amanin Rabbi (hichu houhil tina ahi) hoija na-umjim? ati lhone.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chuin Aman, hung lhonin hung ve lhontan ati. Chuin ache lhonin aumna chu agamu lhonin, chuin hiche ni chun amatoh aum lhontai, hichu nidan som don ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />John thusei ja-a anung juite ni khatjoh chu Simon Peter sopipa Andrew ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama chun amasa penin asopipa Simon chu amun ajah-a, Messiah kamutaove, ati; hichu Christa tina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hitichun Jesu hengah ahinpuijin ahi. Jesu'n ama chu aven, Jona chapa Simon nahi; Kepha nakisah ding ahi, ati (Hichu Peter tina ahi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chuin ajingin Jesu'n Galilee gam lama che agon ahile, Philip amun ajah-a, neijuijin ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Philip chu Bethsaida khomi ahin, Andrew le Peter chenna khomama chu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Philip chun Nathanael amun ajah-a, Athudol Mosi'n danthu bu-a asut le themgaoho asutnu, Nazareth Jesu, Joseph chapa chu kamutaove, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Chuin Nathanael chun ajah-a, Nazareth kho-a kona thil pha soh thei ngaijem, ati. Philip'in ajah-a, hungin lang hung vetan, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jesu'n Nathanael ahenga ahung amun, athudol aseijin; veuvin, Israel mitahbeh, phatlhemna nei louhel khu ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nathanael'in ajah-a, Hoija kona iti neihet ham? ati. Jesu'n adonbutnin ajah-a, Philip'in nakou masanga theichang phung noija na-uma chu kamu ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Chuin Nathanael'in adonbutnin, Rabbi, nangma Pathen Chapa nahi; nangma Israelte lengpa nahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Keiman najah-a, Theichang phung noija na-uma kamu ahitai, tia kasei jeh-a chu natahsan ham? Hiche sanga chu chungnungjo namu ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Chuin aman ajah-a, Tahbeh-a kaseipeh nahi, tunungle van akihona, Mihem Chapa chunga Pathen vantil ho akumsuh akaltou namu ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin ani thum nin Galilee gama Cana kho-ah moupui golvah aumin; chua chun Jesu nu aumin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chule moupui golvahna-a chu Jesu le aseijuiho jong akouvu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin lengpitwi alhahsam phatnin, anun Jesu jah-a, Lengpitwi aneitapouve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n ajah-a, Numei, eini i-ikin umam? Keima kaphat lhung loulai hi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anun lhachaho jah-a, Najah uva asei chan bolun, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chukoma chu Juda te dana kisuhthengna, mon ni mon thum ket cheh songbel gup uma ahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah uva, twibel hochu twi sung dimun, ati. Chuin amahon hicheng chu twi asung dimset taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin aman ajah uva, Tun thalunlang golvah vaihompa henga choijun, ati. Chuin amahon achoitauve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin golvah vaihompa chun twisih lengpitwi kisosah chu atepkhah phat chun, Hoija kon ahi ahepoi (lhachaho athala pangho vang chun ahenauve), chuin golvah vaihompa chun moulang chu akouvin, ajah-a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mitinin lengpitwi achih atungdoh masa ngaijin; chule min adon khop tengle adaojep apejin; nangman tu geijin lengpitwi chih nakoi nalaije, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu'n hiche melchihna kidang chu Galilee gama Cana kho-a abolpat ahin, aloupina aphongdoh tan; chule aseijuihon atahsan taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin chuche jou chun Capernaum'a agachesuh-in, amatoh anutoh chule asopiho le aseijuiho toh ahiuvin, chukoma chun ni sotpi aumpouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin Juda ho kalchuh kut anaitan ahile, Jesu Jerusalem'a ache toutai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin aman houin sungah bongle kelngoi chule vapal johho, chule sum lhengho atouvu agamu-in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin aman khao kiholin jepna asemin, abonchauvin, kelngoi pum le bongchal pumin houin'a konin anodoh-in, sumlheng ho sum aboh lhahpeh-in, adokhangu chu alekhup peh-in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin vapal johho jah-a chun, Hitehohi hia konin podoh un; ka Pa-in hi sumkolveina in'in bol hih-un, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hichun, na-in'a katom pana-in eine chaije, tia kisun chu aseijuihon ageldoh taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hijeh chun Juda hon adonbutnun ajah-a, Thil hicheng nabol hi amelchihna ipi neimusah-um, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n adonbutnin ajah uva, Hiche houin hi suchimun, keiman ni thumin tungdoh inge, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hijeh chun Juda hon, Hiche houin sahna-a kum somli le kum gup jen lut chu nangman ni thuma natundoh ding ong, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amanla ama tahsa houin aseina ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hijeh chun ama athi lah-a kona kaithouva aum phat chun, aseijuiten ajah uva hiche asei chu ageldoh-un, Pathen lekhabua thule Jesu thusei chu atahsan taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kalchuh kut laija ama Jerusalem'a aum pet chun, athilbol melchihna ho chu amuvin mi tamtah-in ama minah atahsan taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahivangin Jesu'n amaho chu angampipoi; ajeh chu aman mi jouse ahetsoh ahin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chule mi thudol min ahetsah ding chu angaipoi; ijeh-inem itile mi lung sunga ipi aum aman ahet sohkei ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pharisai ho lah-a mi amin Nicodemus atiu Juda ho vaipo khat aumin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama chu jan-in Jesu hengah ahungin ajah-a, Rabbi, Pathen'a kona hung houhil khat nahi ti, keihon kaheuve. Ajeh chu Pathen toh kivop louvan melchihna kidang nabol chengse hi koiman abol theipoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin ajah-a, Tahbeh-a kaseipeh nahi, Koi hijongle chunga kona thahpen kit lou chu koiman Pathen lenggam amu theipoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nicodemus'in ajah-a, Mi ateh tengle iti pen thah thei dingham? Aniveina-a anu oisunga lutna peng kit theijam, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Tahbeh-a kaseipeh nahi, Mi koi hijongle twi leh Lhagaova apen loule Pathen lenggam alut theipoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tahsaphe-a kona penga chu tahsephe ahin, Lhagaova kona penga chu lhagao ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chunga kona nathahpen kit dingu ahi tia najah-a kasei chu datmo hih-in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hui khu anun nomna lam lamah anungjin, nangman agin najanan hoija hung kona hoi lama acheji nahepoi: Lhagaova pengho chengse jong chuti chu ahiuve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nicodemus'in adonbutnin ajah-a, Hicheng chu iti hi thei dingham, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin ajah-a, Nangla Juda te houhil nahin, hitiho chu nahet louham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keiman tahbeh-a kaseipeh nahi, Keihon kahet kaseijuva, kamu kahetsah-u ahi, ahivangin kahet tohsah-u hi nanghon nasang pouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keiman nangho jah-a leiset thu kaseija nanghon natahsan louvule, van thuho seileng iti natahsan dingu ham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Van'a uma, van'a kona hung kumlha Mihem Chapa tailou, koima van'a akal khapoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chule gamthipma Mosi'n gul adop sang bang banga chu Mihem Chapa hi kidomsang ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Koi hile Ama tahsan chan chu mangthah louva, tonsot hinkemlou anei ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ajeh chu Pathen'in hibanga hi vannoi angailut jeh-in, Achapa changkhat chu apetan ahi; koi hijongle Ama tahsan chan chun mangthah louva tonsot hinkemlou anei ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ajeh chu Pathen'in Chapa chu vannoi themmo chansah dinga hilouvin, vannoi mite ama vanga huhhinga aum theina dinguva vannoi'a ahinsol joh ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama tahsan chu themmo chang louva ahitai; atahsan lou vang chu themmo changsa um ahitai, aman Pathen Chapa changkhat mina atahsan lou jeh chun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chule themmo achanau chu hiche ahi, vannoi'ah vah ahungin ahivangin achonnau phatlou jeh-in, mihon vah sangin muthim adeijouvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile achon phalou jousen vah ahotbole, achon phatlou chu kisosal khante tin, vah-a chun hung jong ahungjipoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thutah bola vang chu, athilpha bol chu Pathen vanga ahi ti phondohnan vah-a ahungjin ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chucheng nung chun Jesu aseijuite toh Judea gamah ahungun, chuin chukoma chun amahotoh aumin, baptize achansah jin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chule John'in jong Salim kenga Ainon kho-a chun twi atam jeh chun baptize achansah-in; miho chu ahungun baptize ahung changjiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile John songkulla kikhum loilai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hia chun John seijui ho le Juda miho kisuhtheng thudollin akineltauvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuin amaho John henga ahungun ajah-a, Rabbi, ven, Jordan gala naumpi athu nahettohsah, ama chun baptize achansah jin, mi jouse ahenga ahungjiuve, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />John'in adonbutnin, Mi van'a kona kipe lou chu ima achang theipoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nanghotah keima thu hettohsah nahiuve, Keiman, Keima Christa kahipoi, ama masanga hinkisol kahibouve, kati chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mou kichenpia chu moulang ahi; moulang jol akoma dinga athusei ja-a chu, moulang aw gina chu hapa kipahji ahi; hijeh-a chu keima kipana chu kibulhit ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama chu khangtou tou ding ahin, keima kemsuh suh ding kahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chunga kona hung chu mi jouse chunga chungnung pen ahi. Leija kona chu leija mi ahin, leiset thubou asei ahi; van'a kona hunga chu chungnung pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aman amu chanle ajahchan ahettohsah ahin; ahettohsah chu koiman asangpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Athu hettohsah sanga chun, Pathen chu dihtah ahi tia mohor anamdet ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile Pathen sol chun Pathen thubou aseijin; Pathen'in tepten Lhagao apepoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pa chun Chapa chu angailun, thil jouse akhutna apetai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chapa tahsana chun tonsot hinna anei ahitai; Chapa tahsanlou vang chun hinna mulou ding; amavang Pathen lunghan achunga umjo ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin Pakai chun John sangin Jesu'n seijui tamjo asemin baptize achan tamsahjoi ti Pharisai hon ajataove ti ahet phatnin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Jesu'n aman baptize chansah louva aseijuiho abolsah ahi jeng vangin)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judea gam adalhan Galilee gam lama akiletan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chule Samaria gam ajot tei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuti chun Samaria kho khat Sychar atiuva chun ahung lhungtan, hichu Jacob'in achapa Joseph apeh mun kom chu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chukoma chu Jacob twikul uma ahi. Jesu alamjot thacholin twikul panga chun atouvin; hichu nidan gup don ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chukoma chun Samaria numei khat twi thalin ahungin, Jesu'n amanu jah-a chun: Twi don ding neipen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(Ijeh-inem itile aseijuite chu neh ding cho-a khopi sunga chu lut anahitaove).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hitichu ahi jeh chun, Samaria numeinu chun ajah-a, Nangmala Juda mi nahin, Samaria numei keima henga twi don ding nathum chu iti danham? ati. Ajehchu Juda miten Samaria mite thilkeu amanji louvu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin amanu jah-a, Pathen thilpeh henlang chule, twi don ding neipen tia nahenga thuma chu koi ahi helechun; nangman ama henga nathumjoh ding ahin, chutile aman nangma hinna twi peta dinga, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Numeinu chun ajah-a, Pu, nangman athalna ding imala naneipon, twikul'a athuh-in, hintwi chu hoija nalah ham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Twikul hi eipeuva, aman jong dona, achateu le aganchaho donsah-a kapau Jacob sanga chungnungjo nahim? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin amanu jah-a, Koi hijongle hiche twi don chengse chu dangchah kit ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahin koi hijongle keiman kapeh ding twi vang chu adon jouse dangchah kit talou ding ahi; chule keiman kapeh ding twi chun asunga tonsot kemlou hintwi putna twinah sohdoh ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Numeinu chun ajah-a, Pu, hiche twi chu neipen, kadangchah kit louna dingle hikoma gam hichana hi twi thala kahungji louna dingin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Chen na-inneipu gakouvin, hikoma hung lhonin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Numeinu chun adonbutnin ajah-a, Keiman inneipu kaneipoi, ati. Jesu'n amanu jah-a, Inneipu kaneipoi, nati chu nasei dih lheh-e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ijeh-inem itile nangman ji nga nanei ahitai, tu-a nanei khu nangma ji ahipoi; hiche nasei chu adih lheh-e, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Numeinu chun ajah-a, Pu, nangma hi themgao nahi, ti kahedoh tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kapute kapateuvin hiche mola hi Pathen ahoujiu ahi; ahin nanghon, Min Pathen ahouna ding mun chu Jerusalem ahi, nati uve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu'n amanu jah-a, Numei, neitahsanin, nanghon Pa chu nahouna dingu hiche mola jong hilou, Jerusalem'a jong hilou, hitobang phat chu ahung lhunge.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nanghon nahet louhelu nahouvu ahin, keihon kahouvu hi kaheuve; ijeh-inem itile huhhingna chu Juda te lah-a konbou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahivangin phat ahung lhunge, tu hi ahi, chutengle ahou tahbeh hon Pa chu lhagaole thutah-a ahou dingu ahi; ijeh-inem itile Pa chun chutobangho bou chu ahou dinga ahol ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathen chu Lhagao ahi, chule ahouten lhagaole thutah-a hou ding mong ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Numeinu chun ajah-a, Keiman Messiah, Christa atiu chu, hung ding ahi, ti kahei; Ama chu ahung tengle aman ijakai eihil sohkei dingu ahinai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu'n amanu jah-a, Nakihoupi keima hi ama chu kahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuin hiche pettah chun aseijuite ahungun, numeinu toh anakihou chu, adatmo lheh jengui; ahivanginla, Ipi thuma nahim? ahiloule, amanu chutoh ibola kihou nahim, tia khatcha jong aumpouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichun numeinu chun atwi bel adalhan, khopi sunga chun achen, miho jah-a chun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hungun, mi khat, hung veuvin, kathilbol kachonna jouse eiseidohpeh sohkeije; hiche hi Christa hikhat ding ham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amaho khopi-a kon chun apotdoh-un, ama henga ahungui,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hiche pet chun aseijuite ahenga ataovun, Rabbi, an nen, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahivangin aman ajah uva, Nangho het lou an neh ding kaneije, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hijeh chun aseijuite khatle khat akihouvun, Khattouvin neh ding an ahinchoipeh ham? akitiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu'n amaho jah-a, Eisolpa lung gotlam bol, chule akin suhbulhit chu keima an ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nanghon, Chang atna ding lha li aumnalaije, natiji hih-um? Veuvin, keiman nangho jah-a kasei ahi, Khodah uvin, loujao khu gahveovin, tun a-at phat ahi, aminin agusohtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A-at chun athaman asangjin, chule aga chu tonsot hin kemlouvah akholjin ahi; chuti chun atupale a-atpa thakhat tah-in akipah thanom khomji lhone.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chuti chu ahin hichea hin, Khatnin atun achom khatnin a-atji, ti thuhi tahbeh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Natohgim lounao atna kasol nahiuve; michom dangin atohgim ahin, nangho amaho tohsa-a lut nahiuve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chuin, Kathilbol kachonna chengse eisei dohpeh-e, tia hettohsah numeinu thusei jal chun, chuche khopi-a Samaria mi tamtah-in atahsan taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hijeh chun Samaria miho chu ama henga ahungun, amaho chu aumpina dingun angeh taovin ahile; ama chukoma nini anichongin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama thusei jal-in mi tamtah-in atahsanbe taovin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hichun amahon numeinu jah-a, Tun nangma thusei jala katahsanu ahipoi; ijeh-inem itile keihotah-in kajauvin, ama hi vannoi huhhingpa Christa tahchu ahi, ti kahetauve, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chuche nini jou chun, ama chukoma kon chun Galilee lama achetai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile ama gam sunga themgao ja achang poi, ti Jesu amatah-in ahettoh sahsa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hijeh chun Galilee alhun phatnin, Galilee mihon anasangui; ajeh chu Jerusalem'a kut laija athilbol imaho chu amahon aboncha amu sohkeiju ahi; ajehchu amaho jong kut na chu chea ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hitichun Galilee gama twisih lengpitwi asosahna Cana kho-a chun Jesu ahungkit tan ahi. Chuin hikoma chun milal khat aumin, achapa chu damlouva Capernaum'a um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chuin ama chun Jesu Judah gama konin Galilee gamah ahungtai, ti ajah phatnin, ahenga achen, achesuh-a achapa chu agabol dam dingin angehtan ahi; ajehchu ama chu athikoncha ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hijeh chun Jesu'n ajah-a, Melchihna le thil kidang namu lousen tahsanpon nate, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Milalpa chun ajah-a, Pu, kachapa chu athi kah-in hungsuh-in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Nachena dinga kichetan; nachapa ahinge, ati. Mipa chun ajah-a Jesu thusei ho chu atahsanin achetai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Chuin achesuh-in ahile, asohhon ahung lamtouvin, achapa chu adamtai, ahung tiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chuti chun aman, Itih-a dam pan hitam, tin adongin ahile amahon, Janhi nidan sagi dontah chun akhosih-in alhatai, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Hichun Jesu'n ajah-a, Nachapa ahinge tia asei nidan tah ahi chu apan ahedoh tan; chuin amatah le a-insung mi chengsen atahsan taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hiche hi Jesu'n Juda gam adalhah-a Galilee gama ahunga melchihna abolkit anina ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hicheng nung chun Juda miho kut khat aumin, chule Jesu Jerusalem'a agache touvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hia chun kelngoi kot phunga twikul khat uma ahin, amin chu Hebrew paova Bethesda kisah ahin, aleibuh nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hichenga chun ana, mitcho, elbai, nakong chatmo, mihon tamtah twi chaloh ngahjinga luma ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ajehchu itih phat ham kom komle Pakai vantil khat hung kumlhaji-a twi chu ahung cholohji ahin, atwi kicholoh nunga twikul'a kumlha masa penpen chu ipi veija, itobanga na-a hijongle anat chu damhel jeng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hia chun mi khat kum somthum le kum get jen chatmoa ahin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu'n ama chu analup amun kum sottah na-a ahi chu ahen ajah-a, Nadam nom em, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anapa chun adonbutnin, Pu, twi ahung kicholoh tengle twikul'a eikoi lha ding mi koimala kaneipon; kachele kalhun kahle mi dangin eikhelin achejitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Kipatdoh-in, nalupna kichoijin lam jottan, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin mipa chu adam paihel jengtan, alupna akichoijin, lam ajottan ahi. Hiche ni chu Cholngah ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiche jeh chun Juda hon mi akiboldampa jah-a chun, Cholngah ni ahi, nangman nalupna nakichoi chu dan ngai ahipoi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahin aman amaho chu adonbutnin, Eiboldampa tah-in kajah-a, Nalupna kichoijin, lam jottan eiti chu, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amahon adongun, Najah-a, Nalupna kichoijin, lam jottan tia chu koiham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Akiboldampa chunla chukoma mipi tam jeh chun, Jesu la guhthima anavah manga ahitan, aboldama chu koi ahi ahepon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khonungin Jesu'n ama chu houin'ah amun, ajah-a, Ven, akiboldama nahitai; chonse kit tahih-in, ajole akhohjo cheh nachunga chugetninte, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mipa chu achemangin, Juda ho jah-a, Aboldama chu Jesu ahi tin agaseitan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin hiche jeh chun Juda hon Jesu abolse taovin, chule cholngah ni-a chucheng aboljeh chun, thadin aholtauve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahivangin Jesu'n amaho chu adonbutnin, Ka Pan tu gei hin na atongin, keiman jong katonge, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiche jeh chun Juda hon ama thadin ahabol cheh taove; ajeh chu aman cholngah ni apal lhahkeo hilouvin, Pathen apa ahisah-a, Pathen toh kibanga akisei jeh jong chu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hijeh chun Jesu'n adonbutnin ajah uva, Tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Chapa chun ama chamin ima abol theipoi, a-Pan abol amu chachabou chu ahi; ijeh-inem itile aman abolchan chu, atobang banga chu Chapan jong abol ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile Pa chun Chapa chu angailun, athil bol jouse chu avetsahji ahi; kidang nasahna dinguva, aman hicheho sanga hi chungnungjo thil avetsah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile Pan mithiho akaithouva ahinsah banga, Chapan jong ahinsah nomnom ahinsah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pa chun mi koima thu atanpoi, thutan ding jouse Chapa apehdoh ahitai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutia chu mi jousen Pa ajabol banga, Chapa chu ajabol theina dingu ahi. Chapa jabol lou chun ahinsola Pa chu ajabol lou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Kathusei ngaija chule eisolpa tahsan chun tonsot hinna anei ahitai, chule thupi tanna geita louva, thina-a kona hinna-a galkaija ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, phat ahung lhunge, tu hi ahi, mithihon Pathen Chapa aw ajah dingu; chule ajaho chengse chu hing ding ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile Pan amatah-in hinna anei bang chun, Chapan jong amatah-in hinna aneina dingin apen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chule Mihem Chapa ahi jehchun, thutan chaina thuneina chu apen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hiche hi datmo hih-un; ijeh-inem itile phat ahung lhunge, hichea chu lhan khuh-a umho jousen a-aw ajah dingu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chule hungdoh ding ahiuve; thilpha bolteho chengse hinna-a thoudoh dingu, chule thilphalou bolteho chengse themmo changa thoudoh ding ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ajehchu keiman kachamin ima kabol theipoi, kajah bang banga thu katan ahin; kathutan chu dihtah ahi; keiman lunggot lam hol louva, eisola Pa lung got lam chu kaholjoh jeh-in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Keiman keima le keima chungchang kaki hettohsah hile, ka hettohsah chu dih lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka chungchang hettohsah-a michom khat aumin; chule aman ka chungchang ahettohsah chu hettohsahna dihtah ahi ti kahei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nanghon John henga mi nasolun ahile, aman thutah chu ahettohsah-e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahin Keiman hettohsah nahi mihem'a kona kalah ahipoi; hijongle nangho huhhing-a naumna dinguva, hiche hohi kasei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama chu thaomei kong'a le salvah-a tobang ahin; chule nanghon ama vah-a chu chomcha khat nomsah nanom un ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahinla hettohsahna keiman kanei hi John'a sanga chu chungnungjo ahi; ijeh-inem itile toh molso dinga eipeh natoh, ka natoh chengsetah hin, Pa sol kahi chu ahettohsah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chule Pa eisolpa tah chun, keima thudol ahettohsah tai. Nanghon imatih-in ama aw najakhapouve, amel jong namukha pouve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chule athu jong nasunguva achengpoi; ijeh-inem itile nanghon asolpa chu natahsan pouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nanghon Pathen lekhabua thu naholtoh jiuve, ajehchu asunga chu tonsot hinna nanei uva nangaito jeh-un; ahin hicheho chu keima thudol hettohsah ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahin hinna nanei theina dingun, kahenga nahung nompouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Keiman mihem choiat kasangpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahivangin keiman nangho kahenaove, nangho sungah Pathen ngailutna nanei pouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Keima ka Pa mina hunga kahin, nanghon neisang pouve; achom dang khat ama minin hungle, ama chu anasang naovin nate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Pathen na hungkon choi-atna bou chu hol louva, nangho khatin khat choiat kisang touva chu iti natahsan thei dinguham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Keiman nangho Pa henga kaheh dingin ngaito hih-un; naheh jiuva mi khat aumin, nanghon natahsanu Mosi ngei chu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nanghon Mosi chu tahsanleu chun keima neitahsan dingu ahi; ajeh chu aman keima thudol asut ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ama sut natahsan lou vangule, keima thu iti natahsan dinguham?
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hicheng jou chun Galilee dillen, Tiberia dillen kiti, gal lang khat lama chun ache tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin natna neiho chunga melchihna kidang abol ho amu jeh-u chun, mipi atama tamin anung ajuijui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin Jesu mol chunga akaltouvin, aseijuiho toh atou taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chule kalchuh kut, Juda te golvah chu naija ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin Jesu adahdoh-in ahile, mipi atama tam ahenga ahung amun, Philip jah-a, Hiteho neh ding hi changlhah hoija ichoh dinguham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hichu aman apatepna ati ahibouve, ijeh-inem itile abolding chu aman akihetnan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Philip'in adon butnin, Themcha khat chenga chang ding hi jeng jongleu, changlhah makhai jani manin tohponte, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aseijuite lah-a khat Simon Peter, sopipa Andrew'in, ajah-a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hikoma chapang khat aumin, ama hin sap changa kisem changlhah pheng ngale nga ni aneije; ahinla mi hijatpi lah-a hichu ikham hi dingham, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu'n, Miho chu tousah-un, ati. Hikoma chu hamhing tamtah um ahin, chuin mi sangnga jen chu atou taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n changlhah alan; thangvahna aneijouvin aseijuiho ahoppeh-in, chule seijui hon atouho chu ahoppeh-un; chutobang chun nga jong chu, agot chanun apeuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin amaho avasoh phatnun, aman aseijuite jah-a, Hitiho chu amangthah um louhelin, amoh anong chengse chu lohkhomun, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin amahon alohkhomun ahile, sap changa kisem changlhah pheng nga-a kon chun, anehmoh nongu paipeh somle paipeh ni aloh dimui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hijeh chun Jesu'n chuche melchihna kidang avetsah chu amuvin, miho chu akihouvun, Themgao vannoi'a hung dinga chu ama mongmong hi ahi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin leng achansah dinga, acham louva ahung mat dingu ahi, ti Jesu'n ahet phatnin, achangin mol chunga akaltou kittan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin nilhah ahi phatnin, aseijuite dila chun achesuh-un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chule kong'a alutnun, Capernahum lam panga galkai dingin akitol taove. Hichun khola athimtan, ahivangin Jesu ahenguvah ahung hih laijin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin huipi nasatah anun jeh-in twi akinong sang tultul jengin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hitichun ching somni le ching nga ahim ching somthum ahim ajap lhungun, Jesu'n twi chunga lam ajotna kong lam ahinjot amuvin ahile, akichataove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahin aman amaho jah-a, Keima kahibouve, kicha hih-un, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hichun amahon kipah tah-in ama chu kong'a alalut nun: chule hiche pettah chun kong chu ajotnau mun alhungpai tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ajingin dillen gallang khat lama mipi dingho chun, chukoma chu aseijuite lutna tailou chu kong dang aumlou amuva, chule Jesu chula aseijuite toh chuche kong'a lutlouva, aseijuite amaho changbou ahiu chu aheuvin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />(Ahivangin Pakaiyin thangvahna aneija mihon changlhah anehnau komcha, Tiberia'a kon kong dang dang ahungin ahi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuti chun mipi ho chun Jesu ahin, aseijuite ahiuvin aumtapouve ti ahet phatnun, amaho chu kong'a akalun, Jesu holin Capernahum'a ahung taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuin amahon dillen gal lang khat panga ama amuvin, Rabbi, itih-a hilam nalhun ham? atiuvin ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu'n amaho chu adon butnin, Keiman nangho tahbeh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Melchihna kidang namu jeh-u hilouvin changlhah nanehva jeh uva bou keima neiholu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amang thahji an holnan thohgim hih-un, tonsot hinkemlouva umjing ding an holnan thohgim jouvin, hiche an chu Mihem Chapan napeh dingu ahi; ajeh chu Pa Pathen'in ama chu mohor anamdet ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hichun amahon ajah-a, Pathen na katoh theina dinguva ipi kabol dingu ham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu'n adon butnin ajah uvah, Ahinsol hi tahsan leuchun hichu Pathen natoh ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hijeh chun amahon ajah-a, Kamuva katahsan theina dinguva melchihna ipi nabol em? Itobang na natoh nganem?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aman van'a konin aneh dingu changlhah apei, tia kisun bang chun; Kapute kapateuvin gamthipmah manna aneuvin ahi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hichun Jesu'n ajah uva, Tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Van'a kona changlhah napeuva chu Mosi ahipoi; van'a kona changlhah tahbeh chu ka-Pan bou napeuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile Pathen changlhah chu, van'a kona hung kumlha vannoi hinna pepa chu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hiche chun amahon ajah-a, Pakai, hiche changlhah chu a-imatih chanin neipeuvin atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah uva, Keima hi hinna changlhah kahi; kahenga hunga chu gilkel talou ding, chule keima eitahsana chu dangchah talouhel ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahin kaseipeh nahiuve, Nanghon keima neimu vangun, neitahsan pouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka Pan keima eipeh chengse chu kahenga hung ding; chule kahenga hunga chu iti jongle kaledoh lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile keima van'a kona kahung kumlhah hi, keima lunggot bol dinga hilouvin eisolpa lunggot bol dingjoh-a hung kahi bouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Eisolpa Pa lunggot chu hiche ahi, Aman eipeh chengse hi mansah neilou hela, ni nunung nileh aboncha kakai thou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chule eisolpa lunggot chu hiche ahi, koi hile Chapa mu-a, Ama tahsan chan chun, tonsot hinna anei ding ahi; chule keiman ninunung nileh ama kakaithou ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aman van'a kona hung kumlha changlhah chu keima kahi ati jeh chun, Juda ho achungah aphunun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amahi Joseph chapa Jesu, anu apa eihon ihetnu chu hilouham? achutile, iti dana van'a kona hung kumlha kahi atiham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hijeh chun Jesu'n amaho adonbutnin, ajah uva, Nangho khatle khat kihouvin phun hih-un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Eisola ka Pan aloilut loule koima kahenga ahung theipoi; chule ni nunung nileh keiman ama chu kakaithou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Amaho chu Pathen'in ahil hicheh dingu ahi, tin themgaoho lekhabua akisune. Chuti ahijeh chun Pa-a kona ja-a, kihilna neichacha chu, kahenga hungji ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Pathen koma kona hung potdohpa tailou chu, koiman Pa chu amukhapoi; amabou chun Pa chu amu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Koi hijongle keima eitahsana chun tonsot hinna anei ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Keima hinna changlhah chu kahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Naputeu napateu vin gamthipmah manna aneuvin, chule athi gamtaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hiche hi min aneh-a athi louna ding, van'a hung kon changlhah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Keima hi van'a hungkon changlhah hing chu kahi; koi hijongle hiche changlhah ne-a chu, tonsot geija hing jing ding ahi; chule kapeh ding changlhah chu kaphe hi ahi; hichu vannoi mite hinna dinga kapeh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Hichun Juda ho amaho le amaho akinelun, Hichepa hin ineh dinguva asa iti eipeh thei dinguham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n ajah uva, Tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Nanghon Mihem Chapa sa naneh lou uva, athi nadon louvule, nangmaho sunga hinna nei lou nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Kasa ne-a kathi dona chun tonsot hinna anei ahitai, chule ni nunung nileh keiman ama chu kakaithou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile kasa hi an neh tahbeh ahin, kathi hi don ding tahbeh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Kasa ne-a, kathi dona chu, keijah aum jingjin, keima ama-ah kaum jingjie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Pa hing chun eisola, Pa vanga kahin banga hi, koi hijongle keima eine-a chu, ama jong chu keima vanga hing ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Van'a kona hung kumlha changlhah chu hiche hi ahi; napu napa teovin aneh uva athipiu manna tobang ahipoi; hiche changlhah ne-a vang chu a-imatih chana hing jing ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Hiche hi Capernahum'a thu ahil petna, kikhopna in'a asei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Hiche chun aseijuiho lah-a tamtah-in hiche thu chu ajauvin, Ahahsa behseh jenge; kon angai thei dingham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Hichun chuche thua aseijuite phun chu Jesu'n alung sungin ahen, ajah uvah, Hiche chun nakipal lhuhsah-u hitam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Achutile Mihem Chapa hi masanga aumna mun'a akaltou muleu chun i-nati dinguham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Hinna pe-a lhagaobou ahi, tahsaphen imacha aphatchom sahpoi; najah uva kathusei chengse hi, lhagao ahin chule hinna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Ahivangin nalah uva abang bang atahsan lou na-umui, ati. Ajeh chu Jesu'n atila pat atahsan lou koikoi ahi, chule ama matsah dinga chu koi ahi anahet jingsa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Chuin aman, Hiche jeh-a chu najah uva, Pa peh louvin koima kahenga ahung theipoi, kati ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Hichea pat chun aseijuiho tamtah akinung leuvin, amatoh achele ahungleh tapouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n Somleni ho jah-a, Nangho jong nache nomum? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Chuin Simon Peter'in adonbutnin, Pakai, keiho koi henga kache dinguham? Nangman Tonsot hinna thuho nanei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Chule nangma Pathen hing chapa Christa nahi chu keihon katahsanun, chule kaheuve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Jesu'n amaho adonbutnin, Keiman nangho somleni kalhendoh-u hilouham? Ahinla nangho lah-a diabol khat aume, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Simon chapa Juda Iscariot chungchang thudola hichu asei ahi; ijeh-inem itile somleni lah-a ajao vang, melmaho khutna pehdoh dinga chu amachu ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hicheng jou chun Juda hon tha ding agot jeh-un, Jesu Judah gama vale anomta hih-in, Galilee gama avahle tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiche pet chun Juda ho lhambuh kut anaitan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hijeh chun asopihon ajah-a, Nathil bol chengse hi naseijui hon jong amuna dingun, hikom mun dalhanlang, Juda gama chen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile, minthan go-an koiman guhthimin thil abol ngaipoi. Thil hicheng hi nabol ahi ngalleh, vannoi kimusah-in, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ijeh ham itile asopiho jengin jong ama atahsan louvu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n ajah uva, Keima tun kaphat alhing hih laije, nangho phat vang alhing jinge.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vannoi'in nangho naho theipouve; keibou eihouve; ijeh ham itile athilbolu aphapoi tia keiman amaho thudol ka hettohsah ji ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiche kut nachun nangho cheovin; keima vang tun hiche kutna chehih laijinge, kaphat alhing hihlaije, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaho jah-a chun thu hicheng chu aseijin ama Galilee'a aumden tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahivangin asopite hi kutna dinga ache nungun, ama jong lhang phonga hilouvin, guhthimin achen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiche chun Judah hon kut nachun ama chu aholun, Hoija umham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chule mipi lah-a miho chu ama thudola aphun melmul jengui; ajehchu abangin, Ama chu mipha ahi, atiuvin abangin, Ahipoi, mipi lam hilouva apuimang bouve, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahivangin Juda ho ginan ama thudol chu lhang phonga seija koima aumpouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin kut kim dontah ahi-in, Jesu houin'a achetouvin, thu agahil tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin Juda hon adatmo lheh jengun, Hichepan kihilna neikha louva, lekha iti ahet ham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu'n amaho chu adonbutnin, Kathuhil hi kei thu ahipoi, eisolpa-a ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Koi hijongle ama lunggot lam bol nom-an, kathuhil hi Pathen'a kon ahi, keima chama kasei ahi, ahet ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama chama thuseija chun ama kichoi-at ding agot ahin, asolpa choiat ding go-a vang chu, ama chu dihtah ahin, ama-a chu chonphat louna aumpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mosi'n nangho chonna dan napeh lou uham? Nangho khatchan jong chonna dan bang chun nachonpouve. Ibola tha dinga eigo-a nahiuvem, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin mipi chun adonbutnun, Nangma thilha vop nahi; koiham tha dinga nago-a, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin ajah uva, Keiman na khat katongin ahile nabonchaovin hichu kidang nasauve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hiche jeh-a chu, Mosi'n cheptan thu napeh-u ahin; (Mosi'a kon ahijeh hilouvin, puluiho-a kon joh ahin) chule nanghon cholngah nin mi chep natan jiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosi thupeh suhkeh louna dinga cholngah ni-a mi khat chep akitanle, cholngah ni-a mi khat kadamsah hel jeh-a kachunga nalunghanu ham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Alimsoa thu tan louvin, dihtah-in thu tan jouvin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hichun Jerusalem'a kon mi kimkhatnin, Tha dinga agotpau chu ama hi hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahivangin, veuvin, phongtah-in thu aseijin, amahonla ajah-a ima aseipouve. Vaipohon ama hi Christa tah chu ahi ti ahet tahbeh mongu hita ham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahinla ama hi hoija hung kon ahi keihon kaheuve; Christa vang chu akonna koima ahea umlou ding ahi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hijeh chun Jesu'n houin'a thu ahil tolhonin, hatah-in asamin, nanghon keima jong neiheovin, chule hoija kon kahi jong naheuve; ahin keima kachama hunga kahipoi, ahinla eisolpa chu dihtah ahi, ama chu nanghon nahepouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amavang keiman ama chu kahei; ijeh-inem itile keima ama-a kon kahi, chule ama sol kahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hiche chun amahon mat dingin agouvin, ahin aphat alhin loulai jeh chun, koiman achungah khut alhapon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chule mipi lah-a mi tamtah-in ama chu atahsan taovin, chule Christa chu ahung tengle, hichepan abol melchihna ho sanga tamjo abolnah dingham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mipin chutia ama thudola chuche aseijuva aphun melmulu chu Pharisai hon ajauvin; chuin thempu pipuiho le Pharisai hon ama man ding chu sottolho asolui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n, ajah uva aseijin, Chomcha khat nalah uva umtadi nalai ding kahi, chujou tengle eihin solpa henga kache ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nanghon neiholun natin, neimu lou dingu; chule kaumna-a chu nahung thei lou dingu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hichun Juda ho khatle khat akidongun, Eihon ama iholuva imu lou dingu chu, ama hoijabep che ding hintem? Ole Greek mi lah-a cheng chehho henga chea Greek miho agahil ding khattou ham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nanghon neiholun natin neimu lou dingu, kaumna dinga jong nahung thei lou dingu ahi, ati hi ipi aseina ahidem? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chuin kut kichai nin, hichu nipi ni ahin, Jesu adingin hatah-in asamin, Koi hijongle adangchah-a chu kahenga hunghen, hung donhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Keima eitahsana chu, Pathen lekhabun asei bang banga, asunga kon twihing putdoh-a luija long ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hichu ama tahsan hon anei dingu, Lhagao Theng chu aseina ahi; ijeh-inem itile Jesu choi-atna aum loulai jeh-a, Lhagao theng chu kipe loulai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Thu hicheng chu ajauvin mipi lah-a abang bangin, Tahbeh-a ama hi themgao mongmong chu ahi, atiuvin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Akimkhatnin, Ama hi Christa ahi, atiuve. Akimkhat vang chun Christa Galilee'a kona sohdoh ngaijem?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Christa chu David son hi ding, David chenna khopi Bethlehem'a kon hungdoh ding ahi, tia Pathen lekhabun asei hilouham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chuti chun ama thudola chun mipi chu abung bungin akikhentaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chule abangho chun ama chu mat ding agouvin; ahivangin koiman achungah khut alhapouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chuin sottol mimanho chu thempu pipuiho le Pharisai ho henga ahungun ahile, amahon anadongun, Ibola nahinpui daoham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Chuin sottol mimanho chun adonbutnun, Khuchepa thusei tobang khun mi koiman thu aseikhapoi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chuin Pharisai hon adonbutnun, ajah uva, Nangho jong doha lha-a nahiu hitam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Vaipoho le Pharisai ho lah-a khatbeh-in ama chu atahsanem?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ahin danthu helou mipi ho hi sapset changjia ahi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nicodemus (Amaho lah-a khat, janna Jesu henga gachepa) chun ajah uva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Idan uvin mi chu athu ajah masang le athilbol ahet masanga themmo achansah ngaijem? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chuin amahon adonbutnun, ajah-a, Nang jong Galilee mi nahim? Holin lang, ven; ajehchu Galilee'a konin themgao asohdoh ngaipoi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Hichun amaho a-in cheh-a ache taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu vang chu Olivet lhang lama achetan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin jingpitah-in houin'a ahung kittan ahile miho jouse ahenga ahungun, chuin ama atouvin, amaho chu thu ahilin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hichun danthu sunho le Pharisai hon ajon pettah-a kiman numei khat ahinkaijun, alai lungah adinsah-un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu jah-a, Houhil, hiche numeinu hi ajon jeh-a kiman ahin, ajon pettah-a kimandoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hitobang hi songa selih ding Mosi'n danthua eipeh-u ahin, hijongle nangman iti nagelem? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama hehset theina amu nadinguva, apatepna-a hitia chu atiu ahi. Ahin athuseiju chu jalou bangin, Jesu akunin, akhut jungin tol ajihtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahivangin amahon adong tei adong teijun ahile, ama adahdoh-in, ajah uva, Nalah uva chonsetna neilou penin amanu chu songin sep masapen hen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin akun kitnin, tol ajih kit tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chule chuche jahose chu, ase apha ahetnao vin mo achanun, alenpena pat alhumpen geijin, khat khatnin apotdoh gamtaovin; Jesu changseh le alailunga um numei bou chu aumtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin Jesu adatdoh phatnin, numeinu tailou adang amutapon, amanu jah-a, numei themo nachanho hoilam hitaovam? Koiman themmo nachan lou hitam? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amanun, Pakai, koiman themmo eichantapoi, ati. Chuin Jesu'n ajah-a, keiman jong themmo kachanpoi; chetan, tukallin chonsekit tahih-in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n ajah uva thu asei kitnin, Keima vannoi vah kahi; kanung eijuija chu muthima chu vahle louva, hinna vah chu anei ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hichun Pharisai hon, Nangman nangma thudol nahettohsah ahin, nathu hettohsah adihpoi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin ajah uva, Keiman keima thudol kahettohsah hijongle, kathu hettohsah adih ahi; ajeh chu keiman hoija hung kon kahile, hoi lama che ding kahi kahenai; nangho vangin hoija kona hung kahi, chule hoi lama che ding kahi nahepouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nanghon tahsa dungjuija thu natanjiu ahi, keiman koima thu katanpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahin keiman thu tan jeng jongleng, kathutan dihtah ahi; ajeh chu keima kachang kahipoi, keima kahin chule eihinsolpa ka Pa chu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nadan lekha uva, mi ni thu hettohsah chu adih ahi, tin akisune.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima thudol hettohsah kahin, chule ka Pa eihinsolpa chu keima thudol hettohsah ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hijeh chun amahon ajah-a, Napa hoija umham? atiuve. Jesu'n adonbutnin, Nanghon keima jong neihepouvin, ka Pa jong nahepouve; nanghon keima neiheleu chun, ka Pa jong nahet dingu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hicheng hi Jesu'n houin'a athuhil petna, sum kholna mun'a asei ahi; aphat alhin loulai jeh chun, koiman amanpouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hijeh chun Jesu'n ajah uva asei kitnin, Kache mang ding, chule nanghon neihol dingu, chule nachonset naova nathi dingu ahi. Kachena lama nangho hung thei pouvin nate, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hijeh chun Juda ho chun, Kachena lama nangho hung thei pouvin nate atin, ole ama kithat ding hikhat ham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin aman amaho jah-a, Nangho noija kon nahiuvin, keima chunga kon kahi; nangho hiche vannoi'a mi nahiuve, keima hiche vannoi'a mi kahipoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hiche jeh-a chu najah uva, Nachonset naova nathi dingu, kati ahi: kei hi ama chu kahi hi, natahsan louseuva nachonset naova nathi dingu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hijeh chun amahon ama jah-a, Nangma koi nahim? atiuve. Jesu'n amaho chu adonbutnin, Atila patna najah uva kaseiji chu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thu nangho chungchang thudola seiding tamtah le thutan ding tamtah kaneije; ahinla eihinsolpa chu dihtah ahi; chule ama-a kona kajah chengse chu keiman vannoi jah-a kasei ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman Pa thudola asei ahi chu amahon ahedoh pouvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hijeh chun Jesu'n ajah uva, Nanghon Mihem Chapa hi nadop sang tengule, keima hi ama chu kahi, chule kachama ima kabol lou; ahivanga Pa'n eihil bang banga, hicheng kasei ahi hi nahet dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chule keima eisolpa chun eiumpi nai; Pa chun ka changin eilhapoi; ajeh chu keiman alunglhaina lam jengbou kabol jingin ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hiche thu chu asei phat chun mi tamtah-in atahsantai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n Juda mi atahsanho jah-a chun, Nangho kathua hi naum jom jinguva ahile, kaseijui tahbeh nahiuve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />chule thutah chu heuvin natin, thutah chun nalhadoh dingu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amahon adonbutnun ajah-a, Keiho Abraham son kahiuvin, chule imatih chanin koima soh-in kalut khapouve; ahin nakilhadoh dingu ahi, nati chu iti natiham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu'n amaho chu adonbutnin, Tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Koi hijongle achonse chan chu chonset soh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chule soh chu a-imatih chanin ina achengjipoi; chapa vang chu a-imatih chanin in'ah achengji.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hijeh-a chu Chapa chun nalhadoh vangule, chamlhat tahbeh ding nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Abraham son nahiu chu kahenai; ahinla keima tha dingin neigouve, ajeh chu nalung sunguva kathun mun amupoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Keima ka Pa koma kamu chengse kasei ahi; nanghon na-pauva kona namu-u chengseu nabolu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amahon adonbutnun, ajah-a, Abraham kapau ahi, atiuve. Jesu'n amaho jah uva, Nangho Abraham chate hileu chun, Abraham thilbol nabol dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahinla tun keima, Pathen'a kona kajah thutah naheng uva seipa hi, tha ding nangai touve. Abraham hitihin achonpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nanghon napau thilbol nabolu ahi, ati. Amahon ajah-a, Keiho jaocha kahipouve; Pa khat sehbou kaneijui, hichu Pathen ahi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesu'n amaho jah-a, Pathen napau hile keima neingailut dingu ahi; ijeh-inem itile keima Pathen'a kon hungdoh-a hunga kahi; keima kachama hung kahipoi; aman eisol ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nanghon ibola kathu nahet lou uham? Kathu hi nangai thei lou jeh-u ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nangho napau diabol'a kon nahibouvun, chule chuche napau lunggot chu suhbulhit dingbou nanomui. Ama chu atila patna tolthat ahin, chule thutah-a ding lou ahi; ajeh iham itile ama-a chu thutah umlou ahi. Aman thujou asei komle, ama chama aseiji ahi; ajeh chu ama mijou ahin, chule jou pa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Keima vangin thutah kasei jeh-a, neitahsan louvu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Keima hi michonse ahi tia photchetna pethei dinga nalah uva koi nahiuvem? Chule thutah kasei ahile ibola neitahsan lou uham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pathen'a kon chun Pathen thu angaije; hijeh-a chu nanghon nangai louvu ahi, ajehchu nangho Pathen'a kon nahi pouve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chuin Juda hon adonbutnun, ajah-a, Nangma Samaria mi nahin, chule thilha vop nahi, katiu hi dih louham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Keima thilha vop kahipoi; hinlah ka Pa kajabol ahin, nanghon keima neijabol pouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Chule keiman keima loupina ding kaholpoi; ahola leh thutan khat aumnai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Keiman nangho tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Kathu nit chun itihchan hijongle thina amu lou ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chuin Juda hon ajah-a, Thilha vop nahi tun kahe taove. Abraham athitan, chule themgaoho jongla athigam taovin; nangman, Kathu nit chun itihchan hijongle thina atepkhah lou ding ahi, nati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Nangma athi tasa kapului'u Abraham sanga chungnungjo nahim? Chule themgaoho jongla athigam taovin; nangman koi kahi nakiti ham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Keima chang kichoi-an kahile, kaki choi-atna chu imacha hilou ahi; ahinla nanghon ka Pathen ahi natiu, hiche ka Pa chun keima eichoi-at ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ahin nanghon ama nahepouve; hinlah Keiman vang ama kahei; keiman ama chu kahepoi tileng nangho banga mijou kahi ding ahi. Ahinla keiman ama kahei, chule athu jong kangaije.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Napuluiju Abraham chu keima nikho mu ding athanomin; chuin amun, akipah lheh jengin ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Chuin Judah hon ajah-a, Nakum kum somnga bon lhing lou laija, Abraham namu khah ham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah uva, Keiman nangho tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Keima Abraham masang peh-a, Keima ana umsa kahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Chuin Judah hon asena dingin song akilo taove; ahivangin Jesu akiselin, houin'a kon chun apot doh-in, alah tah-u ajotnin, chule achemang tai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin ache achele apena patna mi mitcho khat amun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin aseijuihon adongun, Rabbi, hichepa apena mitcho-a apen hi, ama chonse-a ham, ole anu apa chonse-a ham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Ama chonse-a ahipoi, anule apa chonse-a jong ahipoi, hichea hi Pathen natoh kiphonna dinga ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sun ahi petcha hi eisolpa na katoh ding hivehta. Koiman na atoh thei louna jan hung lhung ding hitahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vannoi'a kaum laise-a hi vannoi vah kahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiche chu asei jouvin, tolah achil asetlhan, achil chun bonlhoh asemin, bonlhoh chu mitchopa mitna chun aloijin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ajah-a, Chen, Siloam (sol tina ahin) twi kul-a gakiphet lhahtan, ati. Chuin ama achen, agaphet lhan ahile kho amun ahungtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin aheng akoma chengsele masanga amitchot musaho chun, Touva khutdojia chu ama hi hilouham? akiti taove;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abangin, Ama hi ahi, atiuvin; adang kimkhatsen, Ahipoi, ama chutoh abange, atiuvin; chuin aman, Ama chu kahinai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hijeh chun amahon ama chu adongun, Achutile i-atile namit hah hitam? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amapan adonbutnin, Jesu atipau khun bonlhoh asema kamitna aloija, Chenlang Siloam twikul'a gaphet lhan, eitia; chua kache-a kagaphet lhahle kho kamu ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin amahon ama chu adongun, Ama chu hoija umtam? atiule, aman, Kahepoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin amahon masanga mitchopa chu Pharisai ho henga apuitaovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu'n bonlhoh asema amit ahasah ni chu cholngah ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hijeh chun Pharisai hon jong, Kho iti namu kit-ham, tin adongun ahile, aman ajah uva, aman bonlhoh kamitna anun, hichu kaphet lhahle kho kamu jenge, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichun Pharisai ho kimkhatnin, Hichepa chu Pathen'a kon ahipoi, ijeh-inem itile cholngah ni anitpoi, atiuvin; kimkhat vang chun, Michonsen hitobang thil kidang abol thei ngaijem? atiuvin; hiti chun amaho lah-a chun akibung khentauve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin amahon mitchopa chu adong kit leuvin, Aman namit hasahpa chu nangman ama chu koi ahi natim? atiule, aman, Themgao, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama mitcho ahia, kho amu kit thudol chu Juda hon, khomupa nule pa agakou masangseuvin, atahsan pouvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin amahon amani chu adongun, Apena pat mitcho-a penga natiu nachapa lhon chu ama hi hinam? Ahile tu-a kho iti amuham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anule apan adonbut lhonin, Ama hi kachapa lhon ahinai, apena mitcho-a penga ahi chu kahe lhone;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-a iti kho amuham vang kahe lhonpoi; chule kon amit ahasah ham jong kahe lhonpoi; ama dongun, upatah ahi, aman achungchang thu kisei nante, ati lhone.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda ho gina anule apan achuti sei lhon ahi; ajeh chu, Koi koi hijongle, Ama Christa ahi, tia seidoh chu kikhopna in'a kona nodoh ding, tia Juda ho amasanga dettah-a kihoulhua ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hiche jeh-a chu anule apan, Ama upatah ahi, ama dongun, ati lhon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin amahon masanga mitchopa chu aniveina-in akouvun, Pathen bou vahchoijin, hichepa chu michonse ahi, ti keihon kaheuve, atiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuin aman adonbutnin, Michonse ahi ahilou kahepoi; masang chun kamit achon tun kho kamui, hiche bou hi kahei, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amahon adong kitleuvin, Ama chun inalom? I aloa namit aboldam ham? atiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman amaho chu adonbutnin, Ajouvin kaseitame, nangai hih-un; ibola najah nom kitleuvu ham? Nangho jong ama seijui nahi nom uham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuin amahon amapa chu ahouseuvin, Nangbou ama seijui nahi; keiho vang Mosi seijui kahibovui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathen'in Mosi jah-a thu asei chu kaheuvin; hichepa vanghi hoilam kon ahi kahepouve, atiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amapa chun adonbutnin ajah uva, Hichu datmo aume, kamit hasahta-a ahivanga hoilam kon ahi nahet louvu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathen'in michonseho thu angaijipoi; Pathen houva le alunggot lama chonpa thubou angaije, ti iheuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Koiham khatnin apena mitcho-a penga amit ahasah-e, ti vannoi leiset um tila pat akijakha hihhele.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama Pathen'a kon hilou hile imacha abol thei louhel ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amahon adonbutnun ajah-a, Nang napum changa chonsetna penga keiho neihilum? atiuvin anodoh taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amahon ama chu anodoh taove ti thu Jesu'n ajan, chuin ama chu amun ajah-a, Nangman Pathen Chapa chu natahsan em? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aman adonbutnin Pakai, ama chu koiham, katahsan ding chu, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Nangman ama namutai, chule najah-a thu seija hi, ama chu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutah-in, Pakai, katahsane, atin ama chu chibai aboh tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n khomu louhon kho amuva, chule khomuho amitchohna dinguva, thutan dinga vannoi'a hi hunga kahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Avela um Pharisai phabep hon chechu ajaovin, ajah-a, Keiho jong mitcho kahiuvem? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah uva, Mitcho hileu chun nachonset nao umlou ding ahin; tu vangin, kho kamui, nati jeh-u chun nachonset nao uma ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keiman nangho tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Koihile kotna lut louva, mun choma kala kelngoi hong sunga lutna chu guchale michom ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kotna lut vang chu kelngoiho chinga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama chu kotngahpan kot ahonjin, chule kelngoite chun a-aw aheuvin; chule aman akelngoiho chu amin cheh-in akouvin, apuidohjin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chule akelngoiho chu ahoidoh soh tengle, amasanguva achejin, kelngoiho chun anung ajuijiuve; ajeh chu amahon ama aw chu aheuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Midang nung vang jui louhel ding ahiuve, akoma kona jammangjo ding ahibouvui; ajeh chu amahon midangho aw ahepouve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiche thulem chu Jesu'n ajah uva aseijin; ahivangin athusei chu ipi aseina ahi ahepouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hijeh chun Jesu'n ajah uva asei kitleuvin, Keiman nangho tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Keima hi kelngoi hong kot kahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima masanga hungho jouse chu guchale michom ahi sohkeijui; ahinla kelngoihon athu-u anangai pouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima hi kot chu kahi; mi keija lut chu huhhing-a umding ahi, chule lutle potle-a, chule hamhing amu ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gucha chu agu dingle athat ding chule asumang dingabou hung ahi. Keima vang amahon hinna anei theina dinguva, chule aneibe chehna dinguva hunga kahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima kelngoi chingpha kahi. Kelngoi chingpha chun kelngoiho dingin ahinna apejie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kelngoi chingtah tah hilou, kelngoiho ama-a hilou, thalah vang chun, ngei hung amu tengle kelngoiho chu adalhan ajamjitai; chutengle ngei chun amanin, kelngoiho chu asuchehji tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile ama thalah ahibouvin, kelngoiho ding chu imacha agelpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima kelngoi chingpha kahi, chule ka kelngoiho kahen, amahon jong keima eiheuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pan keima eihet bangin keiman Pa chu kahei; chule kelngoiho dingin kahinna kapei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiche honga hilou jong kakelngoi kanei nalaije; keiman hiche ho jong chu kagahoilut ding, chule amahon ka aw ahetdingu ahi; chule hong khat, aching khat hung hidoh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keiman kahinna chu kakilah kit dinga kapeh ding ahin; hiche jeh-a chu Pan keima eingailut ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khat touvin eilahpeh ding thu ahipoi, keiman kachama kapeh ding ahibouve. Keiman pehna ding thaneina kaneijin, chule kilah kit theina thaneina jong kaneije. Hiche thupeh hi ka Pa-a kona kamu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thu chucheng jeh chun Judah ho abung bungin akikhen kit taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Alah uva tamtah-in, Hichepa hi thilha vop le mingol ahi; ibola athu nangaiju ham? atiuvin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adangsen, Thu hitobang hi thilha vop thusei ahipoi. Thilhan mi mitcho ho amit ahasah thei ngaijem? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuin Jerusalem'a houin thensona kut aumin, hichu phalbilai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin Jesu houin'a Solomon hongcha-a chun avahlelen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hichun Judah hon aum kimvelun, Itihchan nei lunggim sah dinguham? Christa nahile kichentah-in neisei peh-un, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Keiman najah uva kaseitan, ahivangin nanghon natahsan pouve. Ka Pa mina thil kabol chengse hi kathudol hettohsah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahivangin, najah uva kasei bangin, nangho kakelngoi lah-a nahilou jeh-un, natahsan pouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keima kelngoiho vangin ka-aw aheuvin, keiman jong amaho kahei, chule amahon kanung eijui jiuve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chule keiman amaho chu tonsot hinna kapeji; chutia chu amaho itih chana mangthah lou ding ahiuvin, chujongle koiman kakhutna kona amaho chu eilahpeh lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka Pa amaho keima eipe-a chu, ima jouse chunga chungnung pen ahin; chule ka Pa-a kona chu koiman alahpeh thei lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keimale Pa chu pum khat kahi lhone, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuin Judah hon asena ding song akilo kit taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesu'n amaho chu adonbutnin, ka Pa-a kona chu natohpha tamtah kavetsah nahitaove; chuche na kitongho hoipen jeh-a chu keima songa neiseu ham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Judah hon adonbutnun, Naphatoh jeh-a songa kaseu ahipoi, Pathen nataitom jeh ahibouve; chujongle mihem nahinasa-a Pathen nakihisah jeh ahi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu'n amaho adonbutnin, Nangho hi pathenho nahiuve, kati ahi, tia nadan lekhabu uva kisun hih-am?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathen thu lhunnaho bon pathenho atia ahile, Pathen lekhabu thu chu keh thei ahipoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pan asuhthenga vannoi'a asol chun, Pathen Chapa kahi, kati jeh-a ibola Pathen nataitome, neitiu ham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka Pa na tonglou kahia ahile, neitahsan daovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Katoh ahivangle, Pa chu keija uma, chule keima Pa-a kaum hi nahet theijuva, natahsan theina dingun; keima neitahsan hih jongleu chun, na kitongho chengse behhi tahsan nun, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chuin amahon ama chu mat dingin ago kit taovin, ahinla ama akhutnuva konin apotdoh-in achemang tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chuin Jordan gala, John'in amasa baptize achansahna lama chun achen; chukoma chun aga umtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chuin mi tamtah ahenga ahungun, amaho chun, John'in melchihna kidang ima avetsahpoi; ahin hichepa thudol John'in asei jouse tahbeh ahi sohkeije, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hiche koma chun mi tamtah-in atahsan taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin Mariam le asopinu Martha chenna Bethany kho-a chun, mi khat amin Lazarus atiu chu ati anan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chule ana-a chu Pakai thao nua, asama akeng theh ngima Mariam sopi pa Lazarus chu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hijeh chun asopi numei tenin Jesu henga mi asol lhonin, ajah-a, Pakai, ven, nangman nangailut pa chu anai, agati sah lhone.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu'n hichu ajah phatnin, Hiche nat hi thina ding ahipoi; hichea chu Pathen Chapa choi-atna aumna dinga Pathen loupina dingbou ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu'n Martha le asopinu chule Lazarus chu angailut ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiti chun anai ti ajah chun, aumna-a chun nini aumna laijin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin hiche nung chun aseijuiho jah-a, Judah gama che kit taohite, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aseijuihon ajah-a, Rabbi, Judah ho chunla songa seding nagouvin; khu lama nache kit dingham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Ni khat sunga hi nidan somleni um louham? Mi khat sunlaija vahlea chu, vannoi vah amu jeh-in aki pal ngaipoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahin jana vahlea vang chu, ama sunga vah aum lou jeh-in akipal jin ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hicheng chu aseijin; chujouvin ajah uva, Igolpao Lazarus a-imutai; ahin a-imut sukhang dinga kache ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin aseijuihon ajah-a, Pakai, a-imut tah-a ahile damta vehta, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesu'n hichu athi aseina ahin, ahivangin amahon kicholdo dinga a-imut aseijin angaitouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hijeh chun Jesu'n ajah uva asei chenin, Lazarus athia ahitai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nanghon natahsan theina dingun, chukoma kaum lou chu nangho dingin kakipah-e; hijongle tun hungun ahenga cheohite, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichun Didymus atiu, Thomas chun aseijui chankhompi ho jah-a, Cheovin, eiho jong amatoh thitha dingin cheohite, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin Jesu ahung lhunin, lhana akoiju ni li ahitai ti ahetai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bethany chu Jerusalem kom ahin, ching somle ching nga vela gamlha ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chule asopipa lhon chungchanga lungmonsah dingin, Judah ho tamtah Martha le Mariam henga chun ahungun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin Martha'n, Jesu ahunge ti ajah jah-in, apotdoh-in aga kimutopin; Mariam vang chu in'a chun atouna laije.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin Martha'n Jesu jah-a, Pakai, nangma hikoma um hile chun, kasopipa thi lou dinga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu jengin jong, nangman Pathen henga nathum chan chu, Pathen'in napeh ding kahei, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu'n amanu ajah-a, Nasopipa thoudoh kit ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Martha'n ajah-a, Ni nunung ni-a thokit ni-a athodoh ding chu kahenai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu'n amanu jah-a, Keima hi thokitna le hinna kahi; keima eitahsana chu, thi jongle, hing ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chule koi hijongle ahinga keima eitahsana chu, itih hijongle thi lou ding ahi. Hiche hi natahsan em? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amanun ajah-a, Henge, Pakai, Nangma vannoi'a hung ding, Pathen Chapa, Christa chu nahi katahsane, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuin amanun hiche chu asei jouvin, achen, asopinu Mariam guhthimin akouvin, Houhil chu hikoma aumin, nakouve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuin amanun hichu ajah jah-in, akipatdoh loijin, ahenga achetai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu chu khosung hung lut lou laija, Martha'n akimutopina mun'a chu umnalai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hichun Judah ho a-in'a aumpia alhembi ho chun, Mariam akipatdoh loija apotdoh chu amuvin, lhana kap dinga che ahi atiuvin, ajuijun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuin Mariam Jesu umna alhun phatnin, ama chu amun, akengphang bulah abohkhup jengin, ajah-a, Pakai, nangma hikoma um hile chun kasopipa thi lou dinga, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jesu'n hitia chu amanu aka amu-a, Judah ho ahin lhonpiho jong chu aka-u amu phatnin, alung sunga ahimsan, atinaje akimah jengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hoija nakoijum, atin ahile; amahon, Pakai, hungin, hung vetan, atiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesu akaptai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hijeh chun Judah hon, Veuvin, iti angailut hitam! atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahivangin alah uva abang bang chun, Mi mitcho mit hasah thei hiche mipa hin, hichepa jonghi athi sahda thei hilouham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chuin Jesu asung gila ahimsa kitleuvin, lhan lama chun achetai. Alhan chu kohom khat ahin, akot chu song khatna kising ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesu'n, Song chu tangdoh-un, ati. Athipa sopinu Martha chun, ajah-a, Pakai, tun a-uitai; ijeh-inem itile athina ni li ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Natahsan le Pathen loupina namu ding ahi, tia kasei louham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hichun amahon mithi lupna-a konchun songchu aladoh un ahi. Chuin Jesu avandah-in, Pa, nangman kataona nangai jeh-in, kathangvah-e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chule nangman kataona nangai jinge ti keiman kahei; ahivangin hiche mipi kakimvela dingho hin nangma sol kahi hi atahsan theina dinguva, kati ahibouve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chuin hichu asei jouvin, hasaptah-in asamin, Lazarus, hung doh-in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hichun athipa chu akhut le akeng lhanpona kitom pumin; amai ultheh pona kitom pumin ahungdoh tan ahi. Jesu'n ajah uva, Lhamun lang che sah-un, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chuin Mariam henga hung Judah ho tamtah-in Jesu thibol hochu amuvin, atahsan taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ahivangin abang kimkhat Pharisai ho henga acheuvin, Jesu thilbol chengse chu aga sei taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hijeh chun thempu pipuiho le Pharisai ho chu akikhomun, Eihon ipi iboluham? Hichepa khunla melchihna tamtah abol jing jengin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hiti mohlha leuhen, mi jousen ama tahsanun tin, chule Rome mite hunguva, imunu le ivaiju eilah mangpeh dingu ahi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Chuin alah uva khat, Caiaphas, chuche kum-a chu thempu chungnunga pang ahin, amachun ajah uva, Nanghon imacha nahehih heluve,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Chujongle vaipi aboncha amanthah louna dinga, miho dinga mi khat athi nangho dinga phajo ahi, ti jong nagelpouve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Hiche chu aman ama chama asei ahipoi; chuche kum-a chu thempu chungnunga panga ahito lhona, vaipi dinga Jesu athi ding chu, gaova asei masah ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chule avaipiu chang ding hilouva, vannoi'a chehsa Pathen chate akhop khoma, pum khat ahidohna ding jong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Chuin chuche ni-a pat chun atha theina dingu lung angaitouvin akihousom taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hijeh chun Jesu Judah ho lah-a lhang phongin avahle tapoi; ahin chua kon chun gamthip dep lama Ephraim atiu kho-a chun achen, aseijuite toh chua chun aum jing taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Chuin Judah ho kalchuh kut anaitan; agam agama konin mi tamtah kut masanga ana kisutheng dingin Jerusalem'a acheuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Chuin amaho chun Jesu aholun, houin'a chun adingun, khatle khat akihouvun, Ipi nangai touvem? Ama chu kut na hi hung lou dingham? akitiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Thempu pipuiho le Pharisai hochun, Koi hijongle aumna he-a chun, amat theina dinguva avetsah dinguva, thupeh aneisao ahitai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin kalchuh kut masang ni gup in, anathisa athodoh kit Lazarus umna Bethany'a chun Jesu ahungin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chukoma chun ama dingin jan an asemun; chule Martha'n ajenlen, Lazarus vang chu ankonga amatoh touho lah-a chu panga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin Mariam'in halpibei spikenard kiti thao namtui, man tamtah ser keh ahin choijin, Jesu keng anun, asamin atheh ngimin ahile, agimnam chun insung chu alosoh jengin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin aseijuiho lah-a khat, Simon chapa Juda Iscariot, amatsah-a pang dingpa chun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ibola hiche thao hi dangka jakhat le somnga mana kijoh-a, mivaicha gentheite kipe louham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman hiche ati chu, vaicha genthei akhohsah-a asei ahipoi; ama chu gucha ahin, chule sumdip avop ahin, asunga kikoi chu akilahji jeh-a asei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n, amanu limsah hih-un; amanun kakivui ni-a dinga hiche hi akoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile vaichaho chu nang hotoh naum khom jing naove; ahin keima vang nang hotoh umjing ding kahipoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin Jesu chukoma chun aume, ti aheuvin, Judah ho mi tamtah ama chungchang jeng hilouvin, athi lah-a kona athodoh Lazarus jong chu vet nom-in ahenga ahungtaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahin thempu pipuihon Lazarus sana chu tha dingin akihousom taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ajehchu ama jala Judah ho tamtah chemanguva, Jesu atahsanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ajingin kutna dinga hung mipi atama tamin, Jesu Jerusalem'a dingin ahunge ti ajah phatnun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lusu na akidopmun, aga lamtouvin, Hosanna: Pakai mina hunga Israelte Lengpa chu anun nome; tin asam asamun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n sangan chalgol khat amun, achunga atouvin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vo, Sion chanu, kicha hih-in; ven, na Lengpa sangan nou chunga achongin, ahunge, tia kisun bang chu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hicheng thu chu amasan aseijuiten ahedoh pouve; ahin Jesu choi-atna aumdoh phat chun, hiche thu chu ama thudola kisunsa ahin, amahon hitia chu ama chunga abolu ahi, ti chu ageldoh taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman Lazarus lhana kon akouva, athi lah-a kona athodoh pettah-a aumpi mipi chengse chu, athu hettohsah-a pang ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiche melchihna kidang abol ajah jehtah uva jong chu mipi chun alamtou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hijeh chun Pharisai ho amahole amaho akihouvun, Ima nalo thei louvu namuve; veuvin, vannoi'in anung ajuitai, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hiche kut na Pathen hou dinga hungho lah-a chun Greek mi phabep ajaovin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaho chu Galilee gama Bethsaida kho-a mi Philip henga ahungun, ajah-a, Pu, Jesu chu kamu nomui, ahung tiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Philip ahungin Andrew jah-a ahung seijin, chuin Andrew Philip toh ahungin, Jesu jah-a asei lhone.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n amaho chu adonbutnin, Mihem Chapa choi-at na aum ding phat ahung lhunge.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keiman nangho tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Chang chang khat tolla alhah-a athi loule achangin aum jingji bouve; athi vangle tamtah aga jin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahinna ngailu-a chun achan ding; chule hiche vannoi leiset chunga ahinna ho-a chun tonsot hinna-a dinga akikoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Koi hijongle kalhacha panga chun kanung eijuihen; keima umna-a chu, kalhacha jong umding ahi; mi koi hile kalhacha panga chu, Pa chun ajabol ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tun kalung adongtai; ipi kasei dingham? Pa, hiche nidana kon hin neihuh doh-in. Ahivangin hiche dinga hi tu nidan geija hi hung kahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pa, namin choi-anin, ati. Chuin van'a konin aw ahung gingin, Kachoi-antai, chule choi-an kit nalai ding kahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hichun akimvela dinga mipi chun hichu ajauvin, Van aginge, atiuvin; adangsen, Vantil'in ajah-a thu asei ahi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Hiche aw hi keima jeh-a hung ahipoi; nangho dingjoh ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tu-a hi hiche vannoi hi athu kitan ahi; vannoi'a vaihompa chu kipaidoh ding ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chule keima leija kona dop sanga kauma ahile, mi jouse kahenga kaloi khom ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hichu iti thia athi ding seina-a hitia chu asei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hichun mipi chun adonbutnun, Keihonla Christa chu a-imatih chana umjing ahi, ti danthua kajauvin; Mihem Chapa dop sanga umding iti natiham? Hiche Mihem Chapa chu koiham? atiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n ajah uva, Vah hi nalah uva chomcha khat umnalai ding ahi; muthimin nahinphah ma-un vah aumpet hin vahleu vin; ijeh inem itile muthima vahlea chun achena ding ahepoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Vah chate nahi theina dingun, Vah chu nanei petchao hin, vah chu tahsanun, ati. Thu hicheng hi Jesu'n aseijin, apotdoh-in amaho-a kon chun akiseltai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahin alah uva melchihna kidang tamtah abol vangin, amahon atahsan pouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hiche hi Isaiah themgaovin, Pakai, kathuseiju kon atahsanem? Chule Pakai ban thahat koi henga kilangam? tia asei chu guilhun theina ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hiche thua hin Isaiah'in asei kitleuvin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aman amitnu asuchon, alungu asutah tai; Achuti loule amitnun muvintin, chule alungun heuvintin, chule hung kihei kitnun tin, Keiman boldam get inge, ati; hiche jeh-a hi amahon atahsan thei louvu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hiche hi Isaiah'in ama loupina chu ana mu-a, ama thudol aseina-a kona, asei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Achuti vangin vaipoho jeng jong tamtah-in atahsan taove; ahinla Pharisai ho jeh chun, kikhopna-a konin eikikaidoh khante tin aphongdoh aumpouve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ajeh chu amahon Pathen choiat sanga mihem choiat adeijoh-u ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Jesu'n aw sangtah-in asamin, Koi hijongle keima eitahsan chun, keima hilouva, eisolpajoh atahsan ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chule keima eimu-a chun eisolpa amu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Koi hijongle keima eitahsana chu muthima aum louna dinga, keima vah kahia vannoi'a kahung ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mi khattouvin kathu jahen, tahsan hih jongle athu katanpoi; ijeh-inem itile keima vannoi thutana hung kahipoi, vannoi huhhing ding joh-a hung kahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Koi hijongle keima eidei louva, kathu jong jop lou chu, athutanna khat aumnai; kathusei hochun ni nunung nile athu atan ding ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />ijeh-inem itile keiman kathuneina-a kasei ahipoi; ahin eisola Pa chun kasei dingle kahil dinga thupeh eipeh ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ama thupeh chu tonsot hinna ahi, ti kahei; hiche jeh-a chu kathusei hi Pan eihil bang banga kasei ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kalchuh kut masangin, Jesu'n hiche vannoi'a kona a-Pa henga ache ding phat ahung lhungtai, ti ahen, Vannoi'a um ama-a ho chu angailun akhon ni geijin angailu lhumkeije.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin jan anneh kichaijin, diabol chun Simon chapa Judas Iscariot lung sunga ama matsahna ding lungthim akhumpeh tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu'n, Pan thil jouse ama khutna apeh, chule ama Pathen'a kona hungdoh ahia, Pathen henga chea ahi chu ahen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ajan anneh ankonga konin akipatdoh-in, chuin aposil akoijin, tinotpon alan, akong akigah-in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin aman kisilna kong-ah twi alheijin, aseijuiho keng asilin, akong gahna tinotpon chun atheh pantan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin ama Simon Peter koma ahungin ahile aman ajah-a, Pakai, nangman kakeng neisilpeh dingham? atin ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin ajah-a, Kabol hi nangman tun nahepoi; ajole henan nate, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin Peter'in ajah-a, Nangman itih hijongle kakeng nasil louhel ding ahi, ati. Jesu'n adonbutnin ajah-a, Keiman nangma kasil loule keija nangman chan nanei lou ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simon Peter'in ajah-a, Pakai, kakeng keojeng hilouvin kakhut le kalu jonge, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Akisil jousa chu akeng tailou adang sil lou akhohpoi, apumpin angimsoh nai; chule nangho nangim naove, ahivangin nabonchao nahipouve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ijeh ham itile ama matsah-a pang dingpa chu aman ahetsa ahin; hiche jeh-a chu, aman, Nabonchaovin nangimpouve, ati ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman akengu asil jouvin, apon akilah-in atou kitnin, amaho jah-a chun, Nachung uva ipi bola kahi chu nahetnah-um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nanghon keima Houhil le Pakai neitiuve; hiche natiu chu aphai, ijeh-inem itile keima hichu kahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hijeh chun keima Pakai le Houhil bonin nangho keng kasil leh, nanghon jong khatnin khat keng naki silpeh to dingu thu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ajeh chu keiman nangho kabol banga chu nanghon jong nabolna dinguva, vetsahna-a kabol ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keiman nangho tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Pakai sangin soh achungnung jopoi, asola sangin solchah jong achungnung jopoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hitiho hi nahetdoh uva nabol ule nangho anun noma nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangho nabon chaova thudola kasei ahipoi; keiman kalhendohho chengse chu kahenai; Ahivangin changlhah eineh khompi pan kachunga akengto alamtai, ti Pathen lekhabua thu guilhun theina dinga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu-a kala ahung guilhun tengle, keima hi ama chu kahi nahetna dinguva, ahung guilhun masanga kaseipeh nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Koi hijongle kamisol sang chan chun keima eisan ahi; chule keima eisang chan chun eisolpa asan ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n hiche chu aseijin, alungdong lheh jengin, ajah uva, Tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, nalah uva khat eipedoh-a pang ding ahi, tin aphongdoh tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Seijui ho chu khatle khat akive touvin, koipen asei ahi agelmove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hichea chu aseijuiho lah-a khat, Jesu'n angailut chu a-anga kingai ahin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simon Peter'in Koi pen aseina ham dongin tin amitnin agah houpin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hichun ama akingai bang chun akingaijin, Pakai, hiche chu koiham? tin adongin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Hiche changlhah hal hi kade-a kapeh dingpentah chu ama chu ahi, ati. Chuin aman changlhah hal chu adekot jouvin alan, Simon chapa Judas Iscariot chu apetai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuche changlhah hal akisan joutah chun Satan asungah alut tan; chuphat chun Jesu'n ajah-a, Nabol ding chu bol loijin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahivangin aman ipi dola achuti sei ahi ankonga touho khatchan jong ahedoh pouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile kimkhatnin, Judas khutna sumbom aum jeh-a chu, kutna dinga imanchah dingu gacho-in atiham; ahiloule, vaichaho ikhattou pe dinga Jesu'n asolin angaitouvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuin aman changlhah hal chu akisan jouvin hiche pettah chun apotdoh paijeng tai. Chule hichu jan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichun amapa apotdoh jouvin Jesu'n, Tun Mihem Chapa choi-atnin aumtai, ama-ah Pathen jong choi-atnin aumtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama-a Pathen choi-atna aumle, Pathen'in jong amatah-a ama chu achoi-at ding ahi, chule achoi-at pai jeng ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chapang neochaho, nang hotoh chomcha khat kaum nahlai ding ahi. Nanghon neihol dingu; ahivanga Judah ho jah-a kasei banga, tu-a nangho jah-a jong kasei ahi, Keima chena-a chu nangho nahung thei lou dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Keiman nangho thupeh thah kapeh nahiuve, Nangho khatle khat kingailuto cheh-un; keiman nangho kangailut bangu hin nangho jong khat le khat kingailuvin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nangho nangho lah-a naki ngailut tocheh uva nahiule, nangho chu keima seijui nahiu hichea chu mi jousen ahet ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Simon Peter'in adongin, Pakai, nangma hoilama nache dingham? ati. Jesu'n adonbutnin, Tun nangma kachena-a kanung nunga hungthei pon nate, ajo vangle kanung nunga nahung ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Peter'in ajah-a, Pakai, ibola tu-a nanung nunga kahung thei lou dingham? Nangma jala kahinna jong kapeh ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Keima jala nahinna napeh dingham? Keiman nangma tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahi, thumvei nei seilep masangse-a ahchal khong lou ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangho lungkham hih-un; Pathen tahsanun, keima jong neitahsanun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pa in'ah chenna in nom tamtah aume; umlou hile najah uva kaseitah hih dingham; ajeh chu keima nangho ding mun sema che ding kahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chule nangho ding mun sema kache-a ahile, keima umna-a chu nangho jong naum theina dinguvin, keima hung kitning ting, kahenga dinga kahung puiding nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kachena ding nanghon naheuvin, chule alampi nahenaove, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thomas'in ajah-a, Pakai, nachena dingbon kihe lou uva, alampi iti kahet dingu ham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Keima hi lampi, thutah, chule hinna chu kahi; keija che lou chu koima Pa kom alhungpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nanghon keima neiheleu chun, ka Pa jong chu nahet dingu ahitai; tu-a kal vang he jong naheuvin, mu jong namutaove, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Philip'in ajah-a, Pakai, Pa chu neimusah-un, hichu keiho dinga phaset ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Vo Philip, keima hitihchan nang hotoh kauma jong neihet loulaiham? Keima eimu-a chun ka Pa amu ahitai; achutile Pa chu neimusah-un, iti natiham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima Pa-a kaum chule Pa jong keija aum hi natahsan louham? Keiman nangho jah-a thu kasei chengse hi keima chama kasei ahipoi; Pa chu keija uma na atoh ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima Pa-a kaumin chule Pa jong keija aume kati hi tahsanun; ahilou jongle na kitong chengse jehtah hin tahsanun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keiman tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, keima eitahsana chun, kathilbol chengse hi aman jong abolding ahi; chule asanga lenjojo abolding ahi, ajehchu keima ka Pa henga kache ding ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chule Pa chu Chapa-a choi-atna aumna dinga, ipi hijongle keima mina nathum chanu chu kabolpeh ding nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima mina ipi hijongle nathum chanu chu, kabolpeh ding nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima neingailut ule, kathupeh ho nitnun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima Pa henga taoving ting, chule Aman nangho a-imatih chana naumpi jing dingu, Lhamonsah achom dang khat napeh dingu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thutah Lhagao ngeichu napeh dingu ahi; amachu vannoi'in asang thei pouve, ajehchu mu jong amupouvin, he jong ahepouve; nanghon vang naheuve; ajeh chu ama nangho sunga chenga ahi, um jong hung umding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keiman nangho kaihoi beijin dalha pouvinge; naheng uva kahung kit ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chomkhat joule vannoi min eimu lou ding ahitai, nanghon vang neimu dingu ahinai; ajehchu keima kahin jeh-a, nangho jong nahin dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hiche ni chule keima Pa-a kaum, nangho keija na-umu, chule keima nangho-a kaum hi nahet dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kathupeh ho neija chule nitna chu, eingailua ahi; chule keima eingailua chu ka Pan angailut ding, chule keiman ama chu kangailut na, ahenga kakiphon ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judas (Iscariot hilou) in ajah-a, Pakai, nangma keiho henga nakiphona vannoi mi henga nakiphon lou ding chu itidan ham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin ajah-a, Mi eingailua chun kathu anit ding, chule ka Pan ama chu angailut ding, chule ahenga chu kahunguva, ama chu kachenpi dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima eingailu lou chun kathu jong anitpoi; chule nathu jah-u keija ahipoi, eisola Pa-a chu ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keiman nangho kaumpi petna thu hicheng hi kaseipeh nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahinla Pan kamina ahinsol ding Lhamonsah, Lhagao Theng chun, imajouse nahil sohkei dingu, chule najah uva kathusei chengse hi nageldohsah dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lungmon kadalhahpeh nahiuve; kalungmon kapeh nahiuve; kapeh hi vannoi mi peh bang ahipoi; nalungu donsah hih-un, kicha jong kicha hih-un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Keima kachemanga, chule naheng uva kahung kit ding ahi kati chu najataove. Neingailut ule Pa henga kache ding ahi tia najah uva kasei jeh-a hi nakipa nathanop dingu ahi; ijeh-inem itile Pa chu kei sanga chungnungjo ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahung guilhun tengle natahsan theina dinguva, tu-a aguilhun masanga najah uva kasei masah dem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Najah uva thu tamsei taponge; ijeh-inem itile vannoi lengpa hung ding ahitai; chule aman keijah imacha aneipoi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahinla keiman Pa chu kangailut na, chule Pa chun eithupeh bang banga na katoh ahi hi, vannoi miten ahetna ding ahi. Kipatdoh-un, hikoma konin chetao hite.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima lengpigui tahtah kahi; chule ka Pa aleilhou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keija um abah aga lou lou chu aman apaidohjin; aga chengse chu aha ga chehna dingin amal ngimjin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangho jah-a kathusei vanga chu nangho angimsa nahitaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keijah um jingun, kei jong nangho-a uminge. Abah lengpiguija aum loule achanga aga thei lou banga chu, nangho jong keija naum louvule naga thei lou dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima lengpigui kahi, nangho abah nahiuve. Ama keija uma, Keima ama-a kaum mi chu hagan agaji; ajeh chu kei louvin nanghon ima nabol theipouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi keija umlou chu, abah bangin paidoh-in aumjin, chule agopjin; chule min hicheho chu achom khomun mei sungah asep lutjiuvin ahile akavamjitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangho keija naum uva, chule ka thu nangho-a aum jinga ahileh, nagotchan thumun, kibolpeh ding nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hichea hin nangho haga nagau hin ka Pa choi-at nin aumji; chule hitia chu nangho kaseijui nahi dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pan keima eingailut bang banga, keiman jong nangho kangailut nahiuve; kangailutna-a hin um jingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keiman ka Pa thupeh ho kanit sohkeija, angailutna kaum bang hin; nanghon kathupeh ho nitleu chun, kangailutna-a naum jing dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kakipana nangho-a aum jingna dingle, nakipanao akimna dinga, hicheng thuhi najah uva kasei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kathupeh hiche hi ahi, keiman kangailut bangu hin, nangho khatle khat kingailuto cheh-un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Min ajol agol dinga ahinna apeh sanga ngailut chungnungjo koiman aneipoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kathupeh nabol uva ahile, nangho hi kajol kagol nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukal keiman nangho soh kati lou ding nahitaove; ijeh-inem itile soh chun apakai thilbol ahepoi. Golte kati nahitaove; ijeh-inem itile ka Pa-a kona kajahho jouse aboncha nangho kahetsah soh nahitaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nanghon keima neilhenu ahipoi, keima joh-in nangho kalhen doh-a, nacheuva haga nagauva chule nagau aumna dinga kapansah nahiuve; chutia chu ipi hijongle Pa henga kamina nathum chanu chu, aman napeh dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangho khatle khat naki ngailut to chehna dinguva, thupeh hicheng hi kapeh nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vannoi'in nahot ule, nangho nahot masang uva keima eihot chu naheuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangho vannoi'a hileu chun vannoi'in ama-a chu angailut ding ahi; hinlah tun nangho vannoi'a nahi louvu, vannoi'a kona keiman kalhendoh nahiuvin, hiche jeh-a chu vannoi'in nahotnu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Najah uva, Soh apakai sangin achungnung jopoi, tia kathusei chu geldoh-un. Amahon keima eibolset nule, nangho jong nabolset dingu ahi; kathu nitleu, nangho thu jong anit dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahin amahon eisolpa ahetlou jeh uva chu, thil hicheng hi keima min jala nachung uva ahinbol dingu ahi, .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima kahunga ajah uva thu kahung sei lou hile, chonset anei lou dingu ahin; tuvangin achonset apaomea akilepna dingu aumtapoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima eihoa chun ka Pa jong ahot ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keiman alah uva mi koima dangin abol khah lou thil kabol lou hile, chonset anei lou dingu ahin; tuvangin amahon keima le ka Pa kakop lhonin eimutaovin, ho jong eiho taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahoi hijongle adanthubu uva, Ajeh beijin eihove, tia kisun chu guilhuna dinga abolu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahin keiman Pa koma kona kahinsol ding Lhamonsah, Pa-a kona hungpotdoh Lhagao Theng chu ahungteng, Ama chun keima thudol ahettohsah ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chule nangho jong atila pat kaumpi jing nahi jeh uva chu, kathu hettohsah-a napan dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nakipal lhuh louna dinguva, thu hicheng hi kaseipeh nahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amahon kikhopna-a kona nahin kaidoh dingu; koihile nathat chanu chu Pathen dinga napha tonga kingaito ding phat chu hung lhung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amahon Pa le keima eihet loujeh uva, thil hicheng chu nangho chunga aboldingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahivangin hitiho phat chu ahung lhun tengle, keimatah-in kaseipehsa chengseu hi nageldohna dinguva, thu hicheng hi kaseipeh nahiuve. Keiman nangho kaumpi jeh uva, atila chu kanasei lou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuvanga eihinsolpa henga kache ding ahitai; ahivangin, Hoija nache dingham? tin koiman neidong pouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahin thu hicheng chu kasei jeh-in, nalungu lunghem adimjotai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hijongle keiman nangho thutahbeh kaseipeh nahiuve; kache dinghi nangho dinga phajo ahi; ijeh-inem itile keima kache loule Lhamonsah chu naheng uva hung lou ding ahi; kache vangle, keiman ama chu naheng uva kahinsol ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chule Ama chu ahung teng, vannoi mitehi chonset thudol, chonphat thudol, chule thutan thudola themmo achan aphotchet ding ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chonset thudola athemo naochu, ajehchu amahon keima eitahsan pouve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chonphat thudola athemo naochu, ajehchu keima ka Pa henga che ding kahin, chule nanghon keima neimulou dingu ahitai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chule thutan thudola athemo naochu, ajehchu hiche vannoi pipupa thu kitana ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangho jah-a sei ding thu tamtah kaneije, hijongle tun nadol joupouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thutah Lhagao chu ahung teng vangle, ama chun thutah lam jouse-a nangho napuihoi dingu ahi; ijeh-inem itile aman achama asei lou ding, ajah chan asei dingbou ahi; chule aman khonung thil hunglhung dingho namusah dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama chun keima eichoi-at ding ahi; ijeh inem itile aman keima-a um chengse chu alah-a, chule nangho nahetsah dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pa nei chengse chu aboncha keija ahin; hiche jeh-a chu, Aman keima-a um chengse chu alah-a, nangho nahetsah dingu ahi, tia kasei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chomkhat joule nanghon keima neimulou dingu ahitai; chule chomcha khat joule neimukit dingu ahi, ajeh chu Pa koma cheding kahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hichea chun aseijuiho khatle khat akihouvun, Chomkhat joule neimu lou dingu; chule chomcha khat joule neimu kit dingu; chule, ijeh-inem itile keima Pa henga che ding kahi ati hi ipi eiseipeh-u hintem? akitiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hijeh chun amahon, Chomcha khat jou, ati hiche hi ipi ati naham? ipi asei ahi ihepouve, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Adoh nomu chu Jesu'n ahen, ajah uva, Chomcha khat joule neimu lou dingu, chomcha khat joule neimu kit dingu, kati chu itidol ahi khatle khat kidongtoa nahiuvem?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keiman nangho tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Nangho nakauva chule namao dingu, vannoi mite vang kipah ding ahiuve; nangho nalunghem dingu, ahivanga nalunghemnau chu kipana hung sohdoh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Numei naoso natnin aphah tengle alunghem lhehji-e, ajeh chu aphat hunglhunga ahitai: ahin acha chu asolhah teng vangle, vannoi'a mihem khat apen jeh chun akipahjin, alungdon hesoh chu aheji tapoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hiche banga chu nangho jong tu-a nalunghemu ahi; ahivangin keiman nangho kamukit ding nahiuve, chutengle nalungu kipah ding, chule hiche nakipanao chu koiman nalahpeh lou dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hiche nikho chule keima imacha neidoh lou dingu ahi. Keiman nangho tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahiuve, Pa henga ipihile keima mina nathum channu chu, aman napeh dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu geihin nanghon kaminin ima nathum hihlai juve; nakipanao suhchamkima aumna dingin, thumun chutile namu dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thu hicheng hi keiman nangho jah-a alema kasei ahi; alema sei louva, phongtah-a nangho Pa thu kahetsahna dingu phat hung lhung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hiche ni chule kamina nathum dingu ahi; chule nangho dingin keima Pa henga taovinge, kati ahipoi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile Pa amatah-in nangho nangailu uve, ajehchu nanghon keima neingailuvin, chule keima Pathen na kona hung kahi natahsan taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Keima Pa koma kona vannoi'a hunga kahin; avela, vannoi kadalhah-a Pa henga che kit ding kahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutah-in aseijuiten, Ven, nangman tun thu alema seita louvin, phongtah-in naseije.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangman ijakai nahesoh-in, chule mi koimachan nangma nadoh ding chu nangaipoi, ti tun kahe taove. Hichea kon hin nangma Pathen koma kona hung nahi ti katahsanui, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesu'n amaho chu adonbutnin, Tuabou natahsan um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Veuvin, nangho nangma nangma-a cheh-a navacheh sohkeijuva, keima kachanga neidalhah dingu phat ahung lhunge, henge, ahung lhungtai; ahivangin keima kachang kahipoi, ijeh-inem itile Pan keima eiumpinai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nanghon keija lungmonna namu theina dinguva, thu hicheng hi najah uva kasei ahi. Vannoi'a hesoh gentheina nanei dingu ahi; ahivangin kipah-un; keiman vannoi kajoutai, ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu'n thu hiche chu aseijin, van lam ave, Pa, phat chu ahung lhungtai; Na Chapan jong nangma nachoi-at theina dingin, na chapa choi-anin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangman ama napeh ho jouse chu, aboncha aman tonsot hinna apeh dinga, nangman ama chu mi jouse chunga thuneina napeh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathen tahbeh khatseh nangma, chule nangman nasol Jesu Khrista ahetdoh dingu hi, tonsot hinna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangman bol dinga thil neipeh chu kajouvin, leiset chungah nangma kachoi-an tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chule tun, Pa, vannoi um masanga nangma toh kaneikhom loupina-a chun, nangma tahtoh kigomin neichoi-anin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangman vannoi'a kona neipeh miho jah-a namin kaphon ahitai; amaho nanga ahiuvin, nangin amaho chu keima neipeh ahi; chule amahon nathu anit taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tun amahon nangman keima neipeh thil chengse hi nanga kon ahi ahetauve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ijeh-inem itile nangman keima neipeh thuho chu keiman amaho kapen; chule amahon hitiho chu asangun, chule keima nanga kona hung kahi kichenin aheuvin, chule nangma sol kahi atahsan taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaho dinga katao ahi. Vannoi dinga katao ahipoi, ahin nangman keima neipeh ho dinga bou katao ahi, ijeh-inem itile amaho nanga ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chule keija jouse chu nanga ahin, nanga chu keija ahi; chule amaho-a hin choi-atnin kaume.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chule tu-a hi keima vannoi'a hi umlouva kahitai, amaho vanghi vannoi'a aumna laijuve, chule keima nahenga hung kahitai. Ka Pa Theng, eini pumkhat ihi banga, amaho jong pumkhat ahi theina dingun, nangman neipeh chengse hi, naminin hongin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima amahotoh vannoi'a kaum lai chun, namina amaho chu kanahon ahi; nangman neipeh chengse chu kahong bitnin, khatcha jong amangthah aumpoi; Pathen lekhabua thu guilhunan, mangthah chapa bouchu amangthah tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu vangin nahenga hung kahitai; chule kakipana amahon aneikim nadinguva, vannoi'a hiche thuhi kasei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keiman nathu amaho kapetai; chule keima vannoi'a kahilou banga amaho jong vannoi'a ahilou jeh-un, vannoi miten ahotauve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangman amaho hi vannoi'a konin ladoh-in tia katao ahipoi, agilouva kona nahuhdoh nadinga katao joh ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima vannoi'a kahilou bangin, amaho jong vannoi'a ahipouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na Thutah chun amaho hi suthengin; nangma thu chu thutah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangman keima vannoi'a neisol banga, keiman jong amaho hi vannoi'a kasol ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chule amaho hi thutah-a suhthenga aum theina dinguva, amaho jala keima kakisuhtheng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hitiho chang jeng dinga tao kahipoi, amaho thua kona keima eihin tahsan ding ho jouse dinga jong katao ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pa, keima nangma sol kahi hi vannoi miten atahsan theina dinguva; nangma keija na-uma, keima nanga kaum banga hi, amaho jong eini-a aum theina dinga katao ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chule eini pumkhat ihi banga, amaho jong pumkhat ahi nadingun; nangman keima neipeh loupina chu, keiman amaho kapetai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaho chamkimtah-a pumkhat ahina dinguva, Keima amaho-a kauma, chule nangma keima-a na-uma; chule keima hi nangman neisola, keima nei nangailut banga amaho jong nangailut ahi ti vannoi'in ahetna dinga katao ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pa, nangman neipeh loupina chu, nangin neipehho hin amu theina dingun, keima umna-a chun kakoma amaho jong umleu kati ahi; ijeh inem itile vannoi bul kiphudoh masanga nangman neingailut ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vo ka Pa chondihtah, vannoi miten nangma nahepouvin, kei vangin nangma kahen; chule nangman keima neisol hi, hiteho hin ahetauve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nangman kei neingailutna ngailut chu amaho-a auma, chule keima jong amaho-a kaumna dinga; namin amaho hi kahetsah ahitan, chule kahetsah kit jing ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu'n thu hicheng chu asei jouvin, aseijuiho toh apotdoh-in, Kidron vadung gal lama hon umna-a chun agalkaijun, chuin hon sunga chun amale aseijuiho alut taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama matsah-a pang Judas jong chun hiche kom mun chu ahet ahi; ijeh-inem itile Jesu'n aseijuite apuijia hikoma chu tamtah vei chejiuva ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutah-in Judas'in sepaihon chule thempu pipuiho leh Pharisai ho-a kona sottolleho aloijin, meivah, meisel, chule hem manchah athouvin, hiche kom mun chu alhung taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichun achunga ipi ahung so ding Jesu'n abonchan ahen, apotdoh-in, amaho jah-a chun, Koi naholu ham? tin agadongin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amahon adonbutnun, Nazareth Jesu atiuve. Jesu'n ajah uva, Keima hi kahi, ati. Ama matsah-a pang Judas jong chu amaho lah-a chu dinga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hitia chu aman ajah uva, Keima hi kahi, ati chun, amaho anung chonun tolah alhu jengun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin aman adong kitleuvin, Nanghon koi naholu ham? ati. Amahon, Nazareth Jesu, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Keima hi kahi, tia najah uva kaseitah chula em; hijeh chun keima neiholu ahile hiteho hi chesah-un, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangman keima neipeh chengse khatcha jong kamansahpoi, tia asei chu guilhuna dinga chutia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichun Simon Peter'in chemjam khat anei ahin, asatdoh-in, thempu chungnung sohpa asatnin ahile, ajetlam bilkol asatlhan ahi. Sohpa min chu Malchus ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n Peter jah-a, Chemjam chu apaija khumin. Pan eipeh khona chu kadon lou dingham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin sepaihon le apipuipau toh chule Judah ho sottollehon Jesu amanun akanun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anna henga apui masaove; ijeh-inem itile chuche kum-a thempu chungnunga pang Caiaphas nupapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Miho jouse dinga mi khat athi aphajoi, tia Judah ho thumop chu hiche Caiaphas hi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin Simon Peter'in Jesu nung ajuijin, chutobang chun aseijui dang khatnin jong ajuije. Chuche seijui chu thempu chungnung chutoh kihe-a ahin, Jesu toh thakhatnin thempu chungnung inpi tolah alut lhontan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Peter vang chu kotpo lama adingin ahi. Chuin thempu chungnung toh kihe-a seijui chu ahung potnin, kot ngahnu jah-a chun aseijin, Peter chu asungah apuilut tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hichun hiche kot ngah nungahnu chun Peter jah-a, Nang jong hichepa seijui ho lah-a khat nahi hilouham? atile aman, Kahipoi, atitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chule hiche koma chu soh ho le sottolleho chu dinguva, adap jeh-a meihol akitiuva, kisang lumu ahi; Chuin Peter jong amaho to adingin, mei chu a-oijin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichun thempu chungnung chun Jesu chu aseijuiho le athuhil thudol adongtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesu'n ama adonbutnin, Keiman vannoi mite anga phongtah-a kasei anahitan; keiman Judah ho kikhop khomji namun kikhopna inho le houin'a jenga jong kanahil jingpeh ahi; guhthima kasei aumpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ibola keima neidoh ham? Ajah uva ipi kasei aja-a amaho chu dongtan; ven, ipi thu kasei amahon ahenauve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman thu hicheng chu aseijouvin, akoma ding sottolleho lah-a khatnin Jesu chu akhutphanga angeiphe abengin, Thempu chungnung hitia chu kidonbut ngaijem? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu'n ama chu adonbutnin, Thu gilou kasei ahile, kathusei gilou aphotchenna neihetsah-in; thupha kasei ahile, ibola neiden ham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin Annan ama chu akikan pumin Caiaphas thempu chungnung hengah asoltai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hichea chu Simon Peter'in dinmuna mei a-oi ahin; chuin amahon, Nangma jong aseijuiho lah-a khat nahim? tin adongun ahile, ama akilepmin, Kahipoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thempu chungnung soh ho lah-a mikhat, Peter'in abilkol asatlhah pehpa inko khatnin ajah-a, Keiman hona chu nangma amatoh kamu hilou nahim? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Peter akilep kit tai. Chuin chupet tah chun ahchal akhongtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuin amahon Jesu chu Caiaphas in'a konin thutanna in lama akaitaove; hichu jingkah matah ahin; ahivangin kalchuh kut an aneh theina dinguva, akisuhboh louna dingun, thutanna in'a chun amaho alutpouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hijeh chun Pilate apotdoh-in, amaho chu adongin, Hichepa hehna-a achunga ipi thu naneijum? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amahon adonbutnun, ajah-a, Ama hi khangse lou hile nangma khutna pedoh pouvinge, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuin Pilate'in ajah uva, Nanghon ama hi puijun lang, nangho dan ngaijin athu tantaovin, ati. Judah hon adonbutnun, Keiho dinga mi thading chu dan ngai ahipoi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama iti thia athi ding thudol Jesu'n asei chu guilhuna dinga chutia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hiche chun Pilate thutanna in sungah alut kitnin, Jesu akouvin ajah-a, Nangma Judah te lengpa nahim? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Hichu nangman nachama naseiha, ole mi khattouvin keima thudol naseipeh ham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pilate'in adonbutnin, Keima Judah mi kahim? Nanam mite le thempu pipuihon kakhutna eipehdoh nahi chu; ipi nabolset baham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Keima kagam hiche vannoi hi ahipoi; ka lenggam hiche vannoi hi hile, Judah ho khutna eikipehdoh louna dinga kasohten asat dingu ahi; ahinla tun kalenggam hi hichea kon ahipoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chuin Pilate'in, Ahile nangma leng nahim? ati. Jesu'n adonbutnin, Leng kahi chu naseikhai. Thutah thu hettohsah dinga hiche dinga hi hung penga, hiche dinga hi vannoi'a hunga kahi. Thutah he chan chun ka-aw angaije, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pilate'in ajah-a, Ipiham thutah chu, ati. Chuin hiche chu aseijin, Judah ho henga chun agapotdoh kitnin, ajah uva, Achungah themona kamudoh hihhele.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahivangin nanghon kalchuh kut tengle mikhat kalhadohpeh dingu chonna ngai khat naneijui; hijeh chun Judah Lengpa hi lhadohpeh leuveng nalungu ham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutah chun amahon, Hichepa hihih hen, Barabbas joh hihen, tin asamtauve. Barabbas chu gucha michom ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutah-in Pilate'in Jesu alan, ajeptai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin sepaihon ling lukhuh aphanun, alua akhuhpeh-un, chule ponsandup asilpeh-un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin akoma ahungun, Chibai, Judah te Lengpa! atiuvin akhutnuva adengpan taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin Pilate agapot kitleuvin, ajah uva, Veuvin, akhan gitlouna ima kamu lou nahetna dinguva, ama naheng uva kahin puidoh ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiche chun Jesu ling lukhuh khuhle, ponsandup sil pum chun ahung potdoh-in ahi. Chuin Pilate'in ajah uvah, Veuvin mihem hi! ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin thempu pipuiho le sottolle hon ama chu amutah-un, Thingpel'a khenbeh-in, thingpel'a khenbeh-in! tin asamtauve. Pilate'in, Nanghon kaijun lang thingpel'a khenbeh taovin; ajeh chu keiman akhan gitlouna kamupoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah hon adonbutnun, Keihon dan khat kaneijun, hiche dan dungjuija chu thi dingdol ahi, ajehchu ama Pathen Chapa akihisah-e, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilate'in hiche aseiju chu ajah phat chun, akicha cheh jengtan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thutanna in sungah alut kitnin, Jesu jah-a, Nangma hoija kon nahim? ati. Ahivangin Jesu'n iman adonbutpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hijeh chun Pilate'in ajah-a, Neihou lou dingham? Nangma lhadohna ding jong chule thingpel'a khetbehna ding jong thu kanei hi nahet louham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu'n adonbutnin, Chunga kona kipe lou hile chun, nangman kachunga thuneina himhim nanei lou ahi; hijeh chun nakhutna eipedohpa chonsetna achung nunge, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hichea pat chun Pilate'in ama chu lhadoh ding agotan ahi. Ahinla Judah hon asamun, Nangman mipa hi nalhadohle Caesar jol nahilou ahi; amale ama lenga kisem chan chu Caesar douna thusei ahi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilate'in thu chucheng ajah phat chun, Jesu chu ahin puidoh-in, chuin Songlhongnal atiu Hebrai paova Gabatha, atiu thutanna mun'a chun atoutan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hichu kalchuh kut dinga kigot ni, nidan gup dontah ahi. Chuin Judah ho jah-a, Veuvin, Nalengpau hi! ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahivangin amahon asamuvin, Sumangin, sumangin thingpelah khenbeh-in! atiuvin ahi. Pilate'in ajah uva, Nalengpau thingpel'a kakhetbeh dingham? ati. Hichun thempu pipuihon adonbutnun, Keihon, Caesar tailou leng kaneipouve, atiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutah-in aman ama chu thingpel'a khetbeh dingin akhutnuvah apedohtai. Chule amahon Jesu chu akaijun apuimang taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin athingpel akiputnin Lugu mun atiu, Hebrai paova Golgotha atiu, mun chu jonin achedoh tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hikoma chun ama thingpelah akhenbeh-un, chule mi ni asih langto gelah amatoh akhetbeh thaovin, Jesu chu alailhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin Pilate'in aminchan lekhan asunin, thingpel leh-a chun atah-in ahi. Chule akisun chu, NAZARETH JESU, JUDAH TE LENGPA ti ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesu thingpel'a kikhetbeh na mun chu khopi nai ahi jeh chun, hiche min kisun chu Judah ho tamtah-in asimun; hichu Hebrew paotoh, Latin paotoh, chule Greek paova kisun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hijeh chun Judah thempu pipuihon Pilate jah-a, Judah te Lengpa tin sun hih-in, Aman, Keima Judah te lengpa kahi ati, tin sunbovin atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilate'in adonbutnin, Kasutsa chu kasutsa ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin sepaihon Jesu chu thingpel'a akhetbeh jouvun, aponsil alauvin, hal li asouvin, sepai khat chu khat hal khat cheh achangui; chule asangkhol jong chu alauvin ahi. Asangkhol chu khui lou ahin, alua pat ato geija kikhong lhungkei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hijeh chun khatle khat akihouvun, Hiche hi botsepou hite, koipen changam vang kiveuhite, akitiuve. Pathen lekha bu thua kisei, Kaponsil akihomun, Kasangkhol avangpha pha changhen tin vang asantauve, ti chu guilhuna dinga, sepaihon hitia chu abolu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tun Jesu thingpel koma chun anutoh anu sopinu, Cleopas inneipi Mariam, chule Mariam Magdalene adingun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n anu le aman angailut aseijui chu akoma adin amu phat chun, anu jah-a, Numei, ven, nachapa chu, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuin aseijui jah-a ma chun, Ven, nanu chu, ati. Chuin hiche-a pat chun seijui chun anu chu ama in'ah apuitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hiche jou chun Jesu'n thil ijakai akichai soh chu ahen, Pathen lekhabua thu chu guilhunsoh theinan, Kadang achah-e, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chukoma chu bel khatna theitwi thuh kitung ahin, chuin twichop pon theitwi thuh dimsetnin, hyssop mol leh-a atah-un, akamtoh agah sutouvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuin Jesu'n theitwi thuh chu adonin, Akichaitai, ati. Chuin akaikun alhagao alhadohtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuin kigin ni ahi jeh chun, cholngah ni-a thilongho chu thingpel'a aumden louna dingin, (ijeh inem itile hiche cholngah ni chu niloupi ni ahi,) Judah hon Pilate henga akeng gaheboh dingle, along galah mangna dingin athumun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hichun sepaiho chu ahungun, akikhet behpi amasapa kengle khatpa keng chu aheh bongui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahin Jesu kom ahung geijun, athisa anahitah chu amuvin, akeng ahehbong tapouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin sepaiho lah-a tengcha choi khat chun atengin anah agahsunin ahile, chua chun thisan le twisih ahung longlha paijen jengin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chule amupa tah chun ahettohsah ahin, chule ama thu hettohsah chu tahbeh ahi: chule aman atahbeh asei ahi chu ahei; nanghon jong natahsan theina dinguva, ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathen lekhabua, Agu khatcha jong kihehbong lou ding, ati chu guilhuna dinga, thil hicheng chu soh-a ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pathen lekhabu thu dangman, Amahon asutpao chu avet dingu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chuin hicheng jou chun Arimathea khomi Joseph, Judah ho gina guhthima Jesu seijui hia chun, Jesu long chu pohdoh dingin Pilate henga agathumin ahile, Pilate'in anaphal pehtai. Hijeh chun ama ahungin, Jesu long chu ahung ladohtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chuin Nicodemus, atila jana Jesu henga hunga chun, myrrh le aloes kihal ser somnga tobang ahinchoijin ahungin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chuti chun amahon Jesu long chu alauvin, Judah ho kivui ngai bangin, lounamtui toh tupat ponnemin atomtaovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chule thingpel'a akhetbehnao mun'a chu hon khat uma ahin; hona chu koima lupsahna khah louhel lhan thah khat uma ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hijeh chun Judah ho kigin ni ahi jeh chun, chukoma chun Jesu chu alupsah taove; ijeh inem itile lhan chu akomcha-a uma ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin hapta nikho masa ni jingpin, kho athimna laijin, Mariam Magdalene chu lhana chun agachen ahile, song chu lhana kona tahdohsa aum agamui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiche chun amanu Simon Peter le seijui dang, Jesu'n angailut henga chun, alhaijelin, ajah lhona, Pakai chu lhana konin apomang taove, chule hoija alupsah-u kahepouve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hiche jeh chun Peter achedoh-in, seijui dangpa jong chu ahi lhonin, lhan lama chun ache lhone.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hitichun thakhatnin alhai lhonin ahile seijui dang chun Peter akhelin, lhan phung chu alhung masatai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin akunin asung agahvetle, tupat ponnem ho um chu amun, ahivangin asungah alutpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Simon Peter jong hiche chun anung nungah ahungin, chuin lhan sunga chun alutnin, chule tupat ponnem ho aum chu amun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Alu chunga um ultheh pon chu tupat ponnem ho chutoh umtha louva, akijela atuma anaum agamun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutah chun seijui dang lhan phung lhung masajopa jong chu alutnin, amun, atahsan tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ajeh iham itile athia kona thoudoh kit ding tia asei, Pathen lekhabu thu chu ahet loulaiju ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichun seijuite ni chu a-in lam gela achemang lhontan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mariam vang chu lhan pama chun adingin akap kapmin; aka pum chun akunin lhan sung chu agahven ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abana bang vantil ni Jesu long alupsah naova chu khat alulhuna atouva, khat akeng todopma atou amui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin amani chun ajah-a, Numei, ibola nakaham? ati lhonin ahile, amanun ajah lhonah, Ajeh chu ka Pakai apomangun, hoija akoiju kahepoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutia ati jou chun, akinung heijin ahile Jesu adin amun, Jesu ahi chu ahepoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Numei, ibola nakaham? koiham nahol? ati. Amanun honbol chun angaiton ajah-a, Pu, hikoma kona napohdoh ahile hoija nakoijem seijin, pomanging kate, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Mariam ati. Amanu akiheijin, ajah-a, Rabboni ati; hichu houhil tina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Neitongkha hih-in; ijeh-inem itile keima Pa henga chun kakaltou hih laije; ahin chenlang kasopiho jah-a gaseijin, ka Pa, nangho Pa, ka Pathen, nangho Pathen henga kakaltouve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mariam Magdalene chu achen, aseijuiho jah-a chun, Pakai chu kamutai, atin, chule ajah-a hiche thu asei jong chu agaseije.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin hiche nikho mama nilhah lamin, hapta kipat ni ahito lhonin, aseijuite chu Judah ho gina kot akikha khum petnuvin, Jesu ahungin alah uva ahung dingin, ajah uva, Nachung uvah lungmon umhen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman hiche chu asei jouvin, amaho chu akhut le anah avetsahtan ahi. Chuin Pakai amu-u chu seijuite chu akipah lheh jengun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hijeh chun Jesu'n ajah uva, Nachung uvah lungmon umhen, Pan keima eisol banga keiman nangho kasol nahiuve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuin aman hiche chu asei jouvin, amaho chu ahu alha khumin, Lhagao Theng changun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Koi hile achonset nasuhbeiju chu, kisubeija ahi; achonset na-umsah-u chu, akiumsah ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Somleni lah-a khat, Thomas Didymus atiu, vang chu Jesu hunga chu amaho lah-a chu umlou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hiche chun seijui dangho chun ajah-a, Keihon Pakai chu kamutaove, atiuvin ahi. Ahivangin aman ajah uva, akhutphang thingkil maha kamua, kakhut junga kakhoija, anah kakhutna katham lousen tahsan ponge, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuin ni get jouman seijuite in sunga aum pettah-un, chule Thomas jong amaho toh uma ahin; kot kikhah sohkeija ahin, Jesu ahung kitnin alah uva ahung dingin, Nachung uva lungmon umhen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuin Thomas jah-a, Nakhut jungin hinkhoijin, kakhut teni hi ven; nakhut hin lhangin lang kanah thamin; chule gingchalel louvin tahsanin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thomas'in adonbutnin ajah-a, ka Pakai le ka Pathen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Thomas, Neimu jeh-a natahsan ahi, mu louva tahsan ho anun nomui, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tahbeh-a Jesu'n aseijuite angsunga melchihna kidang tamtah abol ahin, hitiho chu hiche lekhabu sunga hin akisunpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesu chu Pathen Chapa Christa ahi chu natahsan uva, natahsan vanguva ama mina hinna nanei thei nadinguva, hichengse hi kisuna ahibouve.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiche jou chun Tiberia dillen pangah Jesu aseijuite henga akilah kitleuvin; chule akilah chu hiti hi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Simon Peter le Didymus atiu Thomas chutoh, Galilee gam Canna kho-a mi Nathanael toh, Zebedai chapa teni toh, chule seijui dang ni toh um khoma ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Simon Peter'in amaho henga, keima nga manin chenge ati. Amahon ajah-a, Keiho jong kahungdiu ahi, atiuvin ahi. Chuin acheuvin kong khatna gangtah-in alutpai taove. Chule hiche jan chun imacha amanpouvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahin jingkah ahunghi phatnin, Jesu vaokamah adingin; ahivangin seijui ho chun Jesu ahi chu ahepouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hichun Jesu'n ajah uva, Chate, neh ding ima naneijum? ati. Amahon, Kanei pouve, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin aman ajah uva, Kong sih jet lama chun len sepleu chun namat dingu ahi, ati. Hijeh chun amahon asepmuvin ahile, nga atama atam jeh chun akaijou tapouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hichun Jesu'n angailut seijui chun Peter jah-a, Pakai ahi, ati. Peter'in, Pakai ahi, ti chu ajah phat chun, sangkhol aki-ah loijin (ijeh inem itile asagoh keova um ahin) dillena chun achomlhan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahin seijui dangse vang chu nga dimset len akaijun, kongneo khatna ahung kitolun ahi; (ijeh-inem itile amaho chu tolla kona gamla lou ahiuvin, tong ja ni tobang bou kikah ahiuve).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichun tolgo agei phatnun, chukoma chu songmeihol meija kitihle, achunga nga kikoi, chule changlhah amuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah uva, Tu tahtah-a namatnu nga chu phabep galaovin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiche chun Simon Peter kong'a akaldoh-in, nga len ja khatle somnga le thum dimset len chu agakaijin; nga achuti tam vang chun alen chu a-ehpon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah uva, Hungun jing an hung neuvin, ati. Chule Pakai ahi chu aheuvin, seijui ho khatcha jong, Koi nahim? tia dong ngama aumpouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin Jesu ahungin, changlhah chu alan, amaho chu apen, chutobang machun nga jongchu apei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiche chu athia kona athodoh nunga aseijuite henga akilah athumveina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin ajing anneh-u achaijun, Jesu'n Simon Peter jah-a, Jonah chapa, Simon, nangman hicheho sanga hi neingailut joh-em? ati. Aman ajah-a, Henge Pakai; kangailut nangin nahenai, ati. Aman ajah-a, Ka kelngoi nouho vah-in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani veinan ajah-a, Jonah chapa, Simon, nangman neingailut em? ati. Aman ajah-a, Henge Pakai; kangailut nangman nahenai, ati. Aman ajah-a, Ka kelngoiho chingin ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin athum veinan ajah-a, Jonah chapa, Simon, nangin neingailut em? ati. Aman thum veijen, Neingailut em? ati jeh chun Peter alungnom motan, ajah-a, Pakai, nangman ijakai nahenai; keiman nangma kangailut nangman nahenai ati. Jesu'n ajah-a, Ka kelngoi ho vah-in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tahbeh beh-a kaseipeh nahi, nachapan laija chu nangman natai nakigah-a, nachena nom noma nacheji ahi; na-upat teng vangle, nakhut najah-a midangin natai nagahpeh ding, chule nache nom louna lam lama napui ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichu ama iti thia athi-a, Pathen achoi-at ding chu hetsahna-a, asei ahi. Chuin hiche chu asei jouvin ajah-a, Neijuijin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin Peter akiheijin ahile, ajan anneh uva a-anga kingaija, Napedoh-a pang dinga chu koiham? tia donga, Jesu'n angailut seijui chun ajui amui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Peter'in amachu amuphatnin, Jesu jah-a, Pakai, hichepa hi iti dingham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu'n ajah-a, Kahung kahse-a ama hi aumden ding deileng, nang dinga hichu ipidi hiding ham? Nangman kanung juijin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin hiche seijui chu thi lou ding ahi tin sopite lah-a athangtan ahi; ahinla Jesu'n ama jah-a chu, Ama chu thi lou ding ahi, ati ahipon, Kahung kahse-a ama hi aumden ding deileng, nang dinga hichu ipidi hiding ham? ati ahibouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hicheng thu hettohsah-a, chule hicheng thu suna hi hiche seijui chu ahin; chule ama thu hettohsah chu tahbeh ahi ti kaheuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chule hicheng tailouvin jong Jesu thilbol tamtah aumin, hitiho chu abonchan kisun sohkeile, kei ngaiton, lekhabu kisun chengse chu vannoi leiset hin dolponte. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
